&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Senior Infrastructure Solutions Engineer makes Planet&#39;s infrastructure easier to use. Infra Solutions is a small, multi-disciplinary team: engineers who are as comfortable operating a system as building one, and as comfortable in a hard conversation as in a code review. We sit between the teams who build Planet&#39;s platform capabilities and the teams who need them, and our market is every engineering team at Planet, which we earn one engagement at a time. Teams work with us because we make their week lighter, not because anyone told them to, and every team that lands on the platform is infrastructure Planet no longer has to duplicate, secure and pay for.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most of what you do takes the shape of a hands-on engagement with a team that is blocked, mid-migration, or arriving on the platform for the first time. They usually arrive with a proposed solution rather than the problem behind it, and working out the difference is where the engagement starts. From there you own it end to end: the diagnosis, the hands-on fix, the argument for what should change upstream, and the durable artifact that stops the next team hitting the same wall. This is a role driven by unreasonable hospitality (value out of proportion to what anyone asked us for) and backed by solid engineering and operator depth. You have run things in production, and you write the code other engineers depend on. The ideal candidate is energized by other teams&#39; success: someone who would rather ship the thing that makes ten teams faster than own a system outright, and who does their best work in a room they don&#39;t own, with people who are not yet convinced they need help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, remote position based in Germany, the Netherlands or Slovenia. If located near a Planet office, you are expected to work from that office 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end technical engagements: Partner directly with engineering teams to diagnose, unblock, and resolve complex infrastructure challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute critical migrations: Develop reference implementations, tooling, and guidance to transition teams off deprecated systems seamlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate platform adoption: Act as the primary technical contact for new teams onboarding to Planet’s core infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish standardized paths: Consolidate disparate solutions into well-supported, paved-road infrastructure offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable, shared artifacts: Design re-usable libraries, Terraform modules, and Helm charts to solve recurring technical patterns across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance platform observability: Implement instrumentation and attribution tooling to provide visibility into infrastructure cost, usage, and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform platform strategy: Synthesize engineering feedback and common pain points to influence the broader infrastructure roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of professional experience in Platform Engineering, DevOps, or Site Reliability Engineering, including experience leading at least one cross-team project or migration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in technical enablement, developer experience, or solutions architecture with a focus on internal developer productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience operating and maintaining production infrastructure environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise with Kubernetes orchestration, including workload optimization and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Google Cloud Platform (GCP) or other public cloud providers, including its compute, storage, quota, and capacity mode.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Infrastructure as Code (Terraform, Helm, ArgoCD) and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in software development using Go or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate ambiguous requirements into structured, actionable engineering tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills for technical documentation and cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with large-scale block storage (Persistent Disk, Hyperdisk, Ceph, SAN, or equivalent) operated at fleet scale rather than per-service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving large-scale migrations or deprecations that required buy-in from teams outside your reporting line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a consulting-adjacent engineering role (solutions architecture, professional services, or technical account engineering) applied to an internal platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with workflow orchestration (e.g. Temporal), batch and job-execution systems, or large-scale data processing pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and measuring platform adoption: developer-productivity instrumentation, NPS, or internal marketshare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected starting gross salary range for this role is listed below. Individual placement within this range is determined objectively based on gender-neutral criteria such as your skills, qualifications, and professional experience. This position may also be eligible for discretionary bonuses and/or equity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€77.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€96.300 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO statement: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is committed to building a community where everyone belongs and we invite people from all backgrounds to apply. Planet is an equal opportunity employer, and committed to providing employment opportunities regardless of race, religious creed, color, national origin, ancestry, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, childbirth and breastfeeding, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other protected classification, in accordance with applicable federal, state, and local laws. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is an inclusive community and we know that everyone has their own needs. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation during the hiring process, please reach out to ----- or contact your recruiter with your request. Your message will be confidential and we will be happy to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Workato is the leading Control and Execution Platform for Enterprise AI — the neutral platform enterprises trust to put AI to work across their business. Workato unifies data, applications, and processes into a single platform so AI can reliably orchestrate business processes in production at enterprise scale. Built on more than a decade of running mission-critical processes for over half the Fortune 500 — including Nasdaq, Amazon, Cisco, Vodafone, Atlassian, and Lucid Motors — Workato turns over 14,000 enterprise systems AI needs to act on into one governed execution layer. For more information, visit &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.workato.com/&quot; data-tooltip-link-label=&quot;undefined&quot;&gt;workato.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;. We are driven by &lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;and looking for&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our PostgreSQL DBA, you will be the go-to engineer for everything data-layer: index and schema design on multi-terabyte tables, query optimization for application teams, connection pooling, upgrades, and migrations. Our PostgreSQL runs on Amazon Aurora —&amp;nbsp; operating a large, fast-growing fleet consistently: turning one-off procedures into reliable automation, keeping dozens of clusters healthy at once, and helping developers use the database well. You&#39;ll split your time between a support rotation for incoming developer requests and longer-cycle reliability and automation projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In this role, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;ou will also be responsible to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own day-to-day PostgreSQL operations across all production data centers: index creation on large/partitioned tables, query-plan analysis, schema reviews, data migrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with application teams on data-model decisions — design, partitioning, retention, consolidation vs. standalone clusters — and push back with data when a design won&#39;t scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operate and tune Aurora PostgreSQL: parameter groups, replicas, failover behavior, capacity planning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run and evolve our PgBouncer connection-pooling layer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turn manual runbooks into released, repeatable automation: seamless upgrade, switchover, database/user provisioning, grants management (Terraform + Ansible).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive incident response and RCAs for database-related issues, and land the follow-up actions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain and improve database observability (postgres_exporter, VictoriaMetrics dashboards and alerts).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take part in the team&#39;s duty rotation handling developer requests, with protected focus time off-duty.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of hands-on operational PostgreSQL experience (DBA / database reliability role).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong command of query plans, indexing strategy, and performance work on multi-TB tables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Production experience with managed PostgreSQL (Aurora or RDS) and a clear-eyed view of its constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working proficiency with Terraform and Infrastructure-as-Code practices; comfortable in Linux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with connection pooling (PgBouncer or similar) in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Practical experience with logical replication, major-version upgrades, and low-downtime migration techniques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scripting ability (Bash, Python or GO) and an automation-first mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure (AWS preferred); strong incident-management and RCA skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operational exposure to ClickHouse, OpenSearch, or Redis/Valkey, Neo4j.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kubernetes fundamentals (our poolers, proxies, and exporters run on EKS).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Vault, ArgoCD, or GitOps workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfort using AI coding assistants to accelerate routine analysis and tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AWS • Aurora PostgreSQL • Kubernetes • PgBouncer • Terraform • Ansible • VictoriaMetrics • Vault • Linux&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(REQ ID: 2960)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_8220454926977230902gmail-docs-internal-guid-9a9f34f4-7fff-014a-c97c-98ca90610a47&quot;&gt;Algolia is the retrieval intelligence layer that turns intent into trusted, decision-grade outcomes. Powering more than 1.7 trillion queries a year for over 18,000 customers with millisecond latency and 99.999% reliability, we are the recognized leader for Search and Product Discovery by top industry analyst firms. The Algolia platform turns a company&#39;s products, content, and business rules into data that humans, applications and AI agents can act upon. The result is trusted customer experiences with stronger conversions for measurable business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Algolia, we are passionate about helping businesses connect their end-users with what matters most in milliseconds!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Algolia Account Executive, you will be responsible for creating strong relationships with our customers/prospects and building on these relationships to expand our footprint or close new businesses. You should be comfortable researching prospective customers and adapting sales strategies to meet their needs. You will also play an integral role in defining our sales model. You know the ins and outs of Algolia, understand how we can benefit each prospect and will ultimately be the front line of our revenue growth in the German-speaking and CEMEA markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia has been growing exponentially over the past few years with Germany representing one of our core markets. We are now expanding our existing German-speaking team to further accelerate in this region, providing you with the opportunity to become one of the core players in our success story. You will be an important voice in how we address this market and able to gain a lot of visibility both within our fast-growing tech company as well as within the German eCommerce/ retail segment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a resilient problem-solver who isn&#39;t afraid to think outside the box and get their hands dirty? We expect you to take ownership and be able to execute, defining your own territory strategy. We&#39;re looking for candidates who raise the level and bring sales excellence to the revenue organisation. You should value and practice transparency, have the humility to accept your weaknesses and continuously strive to improve both personally and professionally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR ROLE WILL CONSIST OF:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing and growing a sales pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving inbound and outbound leads through complex sales cycles to closed won&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working your network and collaborating with external partners to source and facilitate new projects in the Commercial segment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing and prospecting with an existing account base to drive usage-based and feature-based upsells&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generating new projects from booking self-driven outbound meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building compelling demonstrations with the pre-sales team, sales material and ROI studies bringing value to our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting accurately to help the team hit their numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with sales developers, solutions engineers, customer success managers, legal, partner managers and marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU MIGHT BE A FIT IF YOU HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 - 4 years of experience in a closing role (esp. in B2B, MarTech, SaaS tech sales)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent spoken and written German and English skills, Polish or Czech a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hunter mindset: Strong familiarity with outbound prospecting techniques, tools and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Plus: Experience in working with partners (solution integrators, consultancies, independent software vendors)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-tasker who can adapt to changing situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick thinker, must be able to handle questions on the fly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love tech sales;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a curious mindset and are capable to understand prospects’ pains and how a deep tech solution like Algolia can solve it;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in dynamic environments and are capable to adjust to constant change;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited by the idea of building things and have a structured and strategic approach to working your territory;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You believe you are in charge of your own success and you have the grit to continue going when things get challenging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Algolia does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, military status, veteran status, disability status, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual total cash compensation range (base salary and commission) for this role reflects market pay data within this location. The exact compensation offered for this role may vary depending on specific location and job-related knowledge, technical skills, and experience; and is only one part of our Total Rewards philosophy to compensate and recognize employees for their work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;On-Target Earnings Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€120.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€160.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORKPLACE STRATEGY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s flexible workplace model is designed to empower all Algolians to fulfill our mission to power search and discovery with ease. We place an emphasis on an individual’s impact, contribution, and output, over their physical location. Algolia is a high-trust environment and many of our team members have the autonomy to choose where they want to work and when.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global presence with offices in Paris, NYC, London, Sydney and Bucharest, however we also offer many of our team members the option to work remotely either as fully remote or hybrid-remote employees.&lt;strong&gt; Positions listed as &quot;Remote&quot; are only available for remote work within the specified country. Positions listed within a specific city are only available in that location - depending on the role it may be available with either a hybrid-remote or in-office schedule.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR SOMEONE WHO CAN LIVE OUR VALUES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GRIT&lt;/strong&gt; - Problem-solving and perseverance capability in an ever-changing and growing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRUST &lt;/strong&gt;- Willingness to trust our co-workers and to take ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CANDOR&lt;/strong&gt; - Ability to receive and give constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CARE&lt;/strong&gt; - Genuine care about other team members, our clients and the decisions we make in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HUMILITY&lt;/strong&gt; - Aptitude for learning from others, putting ego aside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for talented, passionate people to help build the world’s best search and discovery technology. We value autonomy, diversity, and collaboration. We’re committed to creating an inclusive workplace where everyone is respected and supported—regardless of race, age, ancestry, religion, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, marital status, color, veteran status, disability, or socioeconomic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR CANDIDATES - Recruitment Fraud Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve recently seen an increase in recruitment scams targeting job seekers. To help protect yourself, please keep the following in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our open positions may appear on third-party job boards, but the &lt;strong&gt;best way to apply safely&lt;/strong&gt; is directly through our &lt;strong&gt;careers page&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All genuine communication from Algolia will come from an ----- email address. If you receive an email from someone claiming to work at Algolia who does not have an ----- email address, please do not respond or share any personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ll &lt;strong&gt;never ask for payments, purchases, or financial details&lt;/strong&gt; during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;READY TO APPLY?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you share our values and our enthusiasm for building the world’s best search &amp;amp; discovery technology, we’d love to review your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Workato is the leading Control and Execution Platform for Enterprise AI — the neutral platform enterprises trust to put AI to work across their business. Workato unifies data, applications, and processes into a single platform so AI can reliably orchestrate business processes in production at enterprise scale. Built on more than a decade of running mission-critical processes for over half the Fortune 500 — including Nasdaq, Amazon, Cisco, Vodafone, Atlassian, and Lucid Motors — Workato turns over 14,000 enterprise systems AI needs to act on into one governed execution layer. For more information, visit &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.workato.com/&quot; data-tooltip-link-label=&quot;undefined&quot;&gt;workato.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;. We are driven by &lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;and looking for&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a visionary &lt;strong&gt;Regional Chief Strategic Architect &lt;/strong&gt;to serve as Workato&#39;s technical authority and strategic advisor to our most critical prospects, customers, and the broader market within their assigned region. The Chief Strategic Architect operates at the nexus of technical credibility, executive influence, and market thought leadership, acting as the external-facing voice of Workato&#39;s innovation and technical vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is not a sales role. It is a strategic, hybrid operator-advisor-influencer position. Chief Strategic Architects act as extensions of the executive team in the field, elevating conversations with senior leaders and positioning Workato as the essential platform for enterprise integration, AI orchestration, and intelligent automation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is accountable for building technical trust across the customer lifecycle - from initial engagement through strategic expansion - while simultaneously shaping how the market understands enterprise integration, AI orchestration, and intelligent automation. The Chief Strategic Architect influences deal outcomes, product direction, and industry perception, ensuring Workato is recognized as the definitive leader in Enterprise Orchestration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 90 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn &amp;amp; Align (Days 0-30)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep immersion into Workato&#39;s AI vision, product roadmap, and GTM strategy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shadow at least 10 executive customer conversations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop initial point of view for engagement with CIO/CTO/CDO personas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage &amp;amp; Formulate (Days 30-60)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead first strategic engagements with enterprise accounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Co-develop executive playbooks with Sales and Product teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish feedback loops with Product and Engineering teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Scale (Days 60-90)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cultivate trusted relationships with C-level executives in 5+ strategic accounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Co-create first AI-driven integration use cases with customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish thought leadership presence through content and speaking opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Trust &amp;amp; Executive Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engage directly with C-level executives (CIOs, CTOs, Chief Data Officers, Chief AI Officers) at enterprise accounts to shape integration strategies that solve complex business challenges&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as trusted technical advisor throughout the customer lifecycle - from initial engagement through expansion - providing strategic guidance rooted in real-world operator experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build lasting peer-to-peer relationships that position you as the go-to expert on enterprise integration, AI orchestration, and automation at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as technical closer in competitive deals, articulating why Workato&#39;s architecture differentiates us from competitors like MuleSoft and Boomi&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence enterprise architecture decisions and multi-year technology strategies at the executive level&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI, Agentic Automation &amp;amp; Enterprise MCP Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape and guide customers&#39; AI and agentic automation journeys, leveraging Workato&#39;s AI capabilities and ecosystem&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advise on the design and adoption of agent-based workflows, human-in-the-loop models, and decision automation frameworks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with customer executives to define enterprise MCP (Model Context Protocol) strategies including context management, secure AI orchestration, and governance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate emerging AI capabilities into practical, scalable enterprise use cases that drive measurable business outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Position Workato as the integration and orchestration backbone for enterprise AI transformation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise &amp;amp; Thought Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish yourself as the recognized authority across iPaaS, API Management (APIM), data orchestration, EDI, and AI/Agentic automation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead &quot;Art of the Possible&quot; workshops that fundamentally shift how customers think about enterprise integration and intelligent automation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent Workato at industry conferences, customer advisory boards, analyst briefings, and partner events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create high-impact thought leadership content: blogs, white papers, webinars, reference architectures, and technical videos&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape industry narratives and best practices that establish Workato as the category leader&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Acceleration &amp;amp; Commercial Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accelerate deal velocity through technical validation, competitive differentiation, and executive trust-building&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify and shape strategic expansion opportunities by uncovering automation, integration, and AI-driven transformation initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Account Executives and Sales Leadership on account strategy, competitive positioning, and C-level engagement tactics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Articulate compelling ROI narratives and business case frameworks that accelerate buying decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrate measurable impact on win rates, deal size, and sales cycle length in strategic opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Advisory &amp;amp; Technical Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead high-impact customer engagements requiring executive-level judgment, architectural vision, and industry expertise&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guide prospects and customers through Enterprise Orchestration vision and roadmap development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop prioritization frameworks for integration, automation, and AI use cases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead technology evaluation and vendor selection processes with enterprise customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design governance, scalability, and enterprise operating models for automation initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Influence &amp;amp; Market Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the voice of the customer to Product and Engineering teams, channeling field insights into actionable roadmap input&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify capability gaps, competitive threats, and market opportunities based on executive-level customer conversations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and refine competitive positioning, objection handling, and differentiation strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define reusable patterns, reference architectures, and technical frameworks that accelerate customer success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence industry analysts and thought leaders to strengthen Workato&#39;s market position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Enablement &amp;amp; Team Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Educate and enable Sales Engineers, Account Executives, and Customer Success teams on complex technical capabilities and emerging trends&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop strategic frameworks, competitive positioning, and executive engagement playbooks for enterprise accounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mentor technical team members, helping them develop deeper domain expertise and executive engagement skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create scalable technical enablement content and programs that amplify your expertise across the field organization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive customer reference creation and participation in case studies, speaking opportunities, and advisory boards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field (or equivalent experience)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;20+ years of technology transformation experience, including integration, middleware, or API management platforms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;15+ years in an Enterprise Architect, CTO, VP Engineering, or similar senior architecture/leadership role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated experience advising C-level executives on technology strategy and enterprise transformation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise security, governance, and operating models&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven track record of driving platform expansion and value realization in enterprise accounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent executive communication skills, including board-level presentations and strategic documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to operate independently in complex, ambiguous environments and take ownership of outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel to client sites up to 50%, with flexibility based on regional needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills / Personal Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Business, or related field&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep knowledge of key enterprise applications: Salesforce, NetSuite, Workday, ServiceNow, SAP, Oracle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with cloud platforms: AWS, Azure, and GCP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with AI/ML platforms and agentic automation frameworks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in a high-growth startup or scale-up environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established personal brand and thought leadership presence in the integration/automation space&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measures of Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Long-term success for this leader will be measured by their ability to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Embed Workato at the heart of technology strategy conversations across the region&#39;s most influential enterprises&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cultivate sustained engagement with senior technology and engineering leaders ensuring Workato becomes synonymous with Enterprise Orchestration and AI orchestration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create a robust pipeline of seven-figure opportunities tied to transformation initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reframe Workato in the minds of decision-makers and analysts as the essential platform for AI-enabled enterprise integration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leave behind scalable playbooks and repeatable narratives that enable go-to-market teams to engage enterprise audiences with authority and credibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Req ID: 2646&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Rithum™ is the world’s most trusted commerce network, accelerating how brands, suppliers, and retailers work together to deliver seamless e-commerce experiences. We provide an unmatched platform for brands and retailers, enabling them to accelerate growth, optimize operations across channels, scale product offerings and enhance margins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, more than 40,000 companies trust Rithum to grow their business across hundreds of channels, representing over $50 billion in annual GMV. Using our commerce, marketing, and delivery solutions, our customers create optimized consumer shopping journeys from beginning to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Strategic Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you own the development and growth of a portfolio of assigned strategic accounts within your designated region. You build and execute strategic sales plans, develop trusted relationships with senior executives and key stakeholders, and identify opportunities to expand Rithum&#39;s value across complex client organizations. You are accountable for meeting or exceeding financial targets by leading consultative, value-based sales engagements and securing high-value, multi-year software and services agreements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rithum empowers employees across all roles to leverage AI and technology to work smarter, move faster, and create scalable ways of working. In this role, you will use AI and data-driven insights to strengthen account strategy, identify opportunities, improve sales effectiveness, and deliver more relevant and impactful client engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Account Growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute account plans aligned to client priorities, commerce strategies, and growth objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet or exceed sales targets by identifying, developing, and closing software and services opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand Rithum’s footprint across client brands, business units, geographies, channels, marketplaces, and capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build qualified pipeline by identifying whitespace and new opportunities within assigned accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Executive &amp;amp; Value-Based Selling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted, multi-threaded relationships with senior executives and key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand client priorities and position Rithum’s capabilities against business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead consultative, value-based conversations and develop compelling business cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex buying groups and build consensus across decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deal Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex sales opportunities from discovery through negotiation and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deal strategies that address client priorities, competitive dynamics, commercial considerations, and barriers to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead negotiations across pricing, terms, procurement, legal, security, and other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply the Rithum Way of Selling to opportunity strategy, qualification, progression, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipeline, Forecasting &amp;amp; AI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a disciplined pipeline and deliver accurate, timely forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high-quality CRM data and use insights to prioritize accounts and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI and sales technologies to strengthen research, account planning, client engagement, and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional deal teams, bringing together the expertise needed to advance opportunities and deliver client value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Client Success, Solutions Engineering, Professional Services, Product, Partnerships, Legal, Finance, and other teams as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share client, market, and competitive insights with Product and business leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of B2B software, SaaS, or technology sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in a closing role selling to strategic or enterprise accounts, or 2+ years selling Rithum solutions to enterprise clients, with quota attainment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in a full cycle quota carrying role; from strategic territory planning, prospecting, developing &amp;amp; closing complex 6 figure transactions (minimum 100k deal size)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent recent quota attainment (100%+ for 4+ consecutive quarters) in a competitive, metrics-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success developing and growing strategic accounts through new opportunities, expansion, cross-sell, upsell, or new use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex sales cycles involving senior executives, multiple stakeholders, and commercial negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of structured, value-based sales methodologies (e.g., MEDDICC, Challenger, SPIN, Miller Heiman, Value Selling, Solution Selling) with evidence of pipeline progression and forecast accuracy, translating solutions into measurable business outcomes and leading cross-functional deal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build pipeline through self-generated outbound prospecting, with measurable activity standards (e.g., 40–60+ daily touchpoints)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to develop account plans, identify whitespace, build pipeline, and maintain accurate forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disciplined use of CRM and sales tools (Salesforce preferred) and sales engagement platforms (e.g., Outreach, Salesloft, HubSpot, LinkedIn Navigator, ZoomInfo) for pipeline, activity, and conversion tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to leverage AI, data, and modern sales technologies to improve sales effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently and travel as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of B2B SaaS, software, or technology sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling enterprise commerce, e-commerce, marketplace, retail technology, or related solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to large brands, retailers, manufacturers, or enterprises with complex buying environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling integrated solutions across multiple products, capabilities, or services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with partner- or channel-influenced sales motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience positioning data-driven or AI-powered solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Marketing, Communications, or a related field preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Up to 25%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that this job description is not designed to cover or contain a comprehensive listing of activities, duties or responsibilities required of the employee for this job. Duties, responsibilities, and activities may change at any time with or without notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What it’s like to work at Rithum&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join Rithum, you can expect to work with smart risk-takers, courageous collaborators, and curious minds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Rithum team, you are valued, supported, and included. Guided by a transparent culture and accessible, approachable leadership, we offer career opportunities aligned to your ambitions and talents. To ensure work and life balance works for you, we also offer an array of resources to support you and your families, including comprehensive benefits and wellness plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rithum you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the leading brands and retailers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect with passionate professionals who will help support your goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an inclusive, welcoming work atmosphere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve work-life balance through remote-first working conditions, generous time off, and wellness days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive industry-competitive compensation and total rewards benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Private Medical Insurance and a Health Cash Back Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance &amp;amp; disability benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan with 4% Company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive time off package with 25 Days of PTO, 8 Company-paid Holidays, 2 paid floating holidays (new in 2026!), 10 paid sick days, 2 Wellness days and 1 Paid Volunteer Day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;£45/month Remote work stipend for internet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to tools to support your wellbeing such as the Calm App and an Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend and learning and development offerings to help you build the skills and connections you need to move forward in your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Charitable contribution match per team member&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rithum is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to providing an environment of mutual respect where equal employment opportunities are available to all applicants and teammates without regard to race, religion, color, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, non-disqualifying physical or mental disability, national origin, veteran status or any other protected characteristic. All employment is decided on the basis of qualifications, merit, and business need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re committed to providing reasonable accommodations in accordance with the law for qualified applicants. If you require assistance during the interview process due to a medical condition or need support accessing our website or completing the application process, please reach out to us by completing the &lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://forms.office.com/r/v1qDcUpHLw&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-248713042&quot;&gt;Accommodations Request Form&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and accessibility are important to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure a seamless experience as you explore opportunities with our team.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Rithum™ is the world’s most trusted commerce network, accelerating how brands, suppliers, and retailers work together to deliver seamless e-commerce experiences. We provide an unmatched platform for brands and retailers, enabling them to accelerate growth, optimize operations across channels, scale product offerings and enhance margins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, more than 40,000 companies trust Rithum to grow their business across hundreds of channels, representing over $50 billion in annual GMV. Using our commerce, marketing, and delivery solutions, our customers create optimized consumer shopping journeys from beginning to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Account Executive in our EMEA region, you are responsible for developing relationships and closing new business opportunities with online brands and retailers with a focus on the EMEA Region. You are responsible for driving revenue within our Core Business clients by managing the sales process from start to finish including prospecting, identifying and establishing relationships with key decision makers, product demonstrations, contract negotiations, and closure of deals. As a Senior Account executive, you take a truly strategic, consultative sales approach with a hunter mentality partnering closely with the Sales Manager and Sales Director to ensure revenue forecasts and client acquisition targets are met or exceeded quarterly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive sales, expand the client base, and generate new revenue from new leads and existing clients;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a self-sourced pipeline to improve the book of business constantly. Build and maintain strong relationships with prospects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead in-person client presentations including qualifying discovery sessions, product demonstrations, and proposals;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with prospects to understand their unique and specific &quot;pain points&quot; and produce compelling business cases to meet their needs, while delivering factual and insightful feedback to marketing, product, and client success teams;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage Salesforce data to construct, forecast, and manage your own sales activity and drive pipeline to meet revenue targets and company goals;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal product teams and provide feedback from the frontline of the business to help shape future product developments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your manager to provide input on the growth of the business and align revenue strategies with overall company objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and put into practice all areas of the Rithum selling methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently meet quota expectations and qualified opportunity generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of SaaS or technology sales experience in a closing role, selling to key accounts ($50M–$1B+ in revenue).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success managing 3+ month sales cycles, including procurement, legal, and compliance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documented history of closing $50K+ ACV deals, including multi-year contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent quota attainment (100%+ for 4+ consecutive quarters) in a competitive, metrics-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build pipeline through self-generated outbound prospecting, with measurable activity standards (e.g., 40–60+ daily touchpoints, 10+ qualified meetings per month).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hunter mindset, with resilience and persistence in competitive environments and accountability for pipeline creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of structured sales methodologies (e.g., MEDDIC, Challenger, SPIN, Miller Heiman, Solution Selling) with evidence of pipeline progression and forecast accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to sell complex platforms or solution offerings in multi-stakeholder environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging C-suite and senior executive stakeholders to build consensus and close complex new-logo deals as well as expansions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong deal strategy and negotiation skills, including pricing, ROI justification, and defending business cases with executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage 10+ concurrent opportunities while balancing prospecting, deal progression, and strategic follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional executive communication and presence, including clear, persuasive verbal and written communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disciplined use of CRM and sales tools (Salesforce preferred) and sales engagement platforms (e.g., Outreach, Salesloft, HubSpot, LinkedIn Navigator, ZoomInfo) for pipeline, activity, and conversion tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to collaborate cross-functionally with Marketing, Product, Client Success, and Solutions Engineering to close new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent in Business, Marketing, Communications, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into commerce, retail technology, marketplaces, or digital ecosystem platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into multi-division or decentralized buying environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with partner- or channel-influenced sales motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience positioning data-driven or AI-powered solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Up to 50%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
