&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Autonomous Drone Software Engineer to join a swarming programme. As an engineer on a lean, high-impact team, you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not be siloed; this role spans the entire autonomy lifecycle, from developing autonomy capabilities to investigating real-world flight-test data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across the autonomy stack and partner integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with hardware engineers, product managers, and external partners to define system requirements and translate them into robust software architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement robust distributed state machines, leader election protocols, and fault-tolerant architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code while confidently managing complex concurrency and contention scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run rigorous tests utilizing SITL/HITL simulation environments to validate code prior to physical deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in code reviews, architectural discussions, and technical documentation to elevate the team&#39;s engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act decisively during flight-test investigations, applying strong engineering judgment to physical failure modes and release safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional engineering experience in robotics, embedded systems, or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in modern C++, with practical experience designing, reasoning about, and debugging highly concurrent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded systems experience working close to hardware on real-time or safety-critical platforms (e.g., avionics, automotive, robotics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural understanding of distributed systems, with the ability to deliberately evaluate and select consensus designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with robust release management, versioned artifacts, and pinned dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4, MAVLink, and related drone software ecosystems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Remote, occasionally Zurich · 80–100% · Start as soon as possible ·&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Xebia&lt;/strong&gt; pushes the boundaries of what’s possible – and you’re right in the middle of it! We’re not just consultants, but visionaries: with more than 5,000 experts worldwide, we help our clients drive their digital transformation with passion and ambition. At Xebia, it’s about more than recommendations: with innovative solutions, we create a unique combination of technology, people and processes. Our goal is to make our clients digital frontrunners – ready to turn media usage data into insights that make a difference?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our client, a large Swiss media company, is building a new platform on Azure Databricks for the usage data of its apps and websites. It will replace the commercial analytics tool they use today. Analysts are starting to work on the new platform now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You join the platform team of five developers through Xebia. Most of your time goes into implementing Jira tickets. You build and run the pipelines that take event data from Azure Event Hubs through the bronze, silver and gold layers into the tables analysts and dashboards use. You keep the Databricks and Azure infrastructure in code with Pulumi and ship changes through GitHub Actions. The team creates and refines tickets together and reviews each other&#39;s code. You&#39;ll also help analysts get started with Databricks and GitHub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the senior person in the team, you can advise on anything from implementation details to the overall architecture, while the product owner sets the priorities. Today the role also covers the data model, the infrastructure and the platform costs, and there is room to take on more responsibility over time. The team uses AI coding assistants such as Claude in its daily work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Several years of hands-on data engineering on Databricks: building and running production pipelines with Spark, PySpark or SQL and Delta Lake, in a medallion architecture&lt;br&gt;• Architecture experience on a Databricks or Azure data platform&lt;br&gt;• Streaming or event ingestion, ideally Azure Event Hubs or Kafka&lt;br&gt;• Data modelling for analytics and BI&lt;br&gt;• Infrastructure as code, ideally Pulumi (Terraform experience transfers)&lt;br&gt;• Git, GitHub workflows and CI/CD with GitHub Actions&lt;br&gt;• Experience in larger projects&lt;br&gt;• You work well in a team and get productive with little onboarding&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable using AI coding assistants&lt;br&gt;• Fluent English&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Unity Catalog, Databricks Asset Bundles, data quality frameworks&lt;br&gt;• Dashboards in Databricks or Power BI&lt;br&gt;• Azure experience beyond Databricks&lt;br&gt;• Web and app usage tracking or digital analytics, including tracking migrations&lt;br&gt;• Media or broadcasting experience&lt;br&gt;• German&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The current engineer can hand over until the end of January. English is the working language; German is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes us special&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;Innovation potential:&lt;/strong&gt; At Xebia, the focus is on innovation and pioneering spirit. You can develop your creative ideas and share innovative thoughts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Personal growth:&lt;/strong&gt; We believe in personal development for outstanding professional experiences. Unlock your potential and keep growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Community and networking:&lt;/strong&gt; Xebia is a community of technology enthusiasts. Meet professionals from different fields, share knowledge and shape innovation together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⚖️ &lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We value work-life balance. Adapt your working hours and find a balance between your career and your personal life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎉 &lt;strong&gt;Great social events:&lt;/strong&gt; Ski days, B2run, spontaneous after-work apéros, Christmas and summer parties – we celebrate together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re ready to take your professional journey further, we warmly welcome you to Xebia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to meeting you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Electra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Air travel is about to become something more: more direct, more accessible, and more connected to the places where people live, work and want to be. Every day in the U.S., people make 35 million trips of 50–500 miles, stuck in traffic or routed through crowded hubs. Chances are, you&#39;ve been one of them. At Electra, we&#39;re changing that with the EL9, a nine-passenger, hybrid-electric aircraft that takes off and lands in just 150 feet. Our Ultra Short technology opens up thousands of new places to fly, beyond conventional runways, congested airports and long drives. We&#39;re backed by Lockheed Martin, Honeywell and Safran. Operators worldwide have signed intent-to-purchase agreements for the first 2,200 aircraft we produce, and we&#39;re moving toward first test flights in 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Getting a new kind of aircraft airborne takes more than ambition. It takes our kind of bold: people who think big while working in the real world. Who move ideas into action and collaborate without silos. Who put people first and make room at the table for everyone. Who challenge one another without diminishing one another.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Sound like you? Then look beyond what you thought were your own limits, and help us take flight beyond runways.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Electra seeks an experienced Program Manager to lead the planning and execution of a European tour for Electra&#39;s EL2 technology demonstrator aircraft. This role will serve as the primary team lead for the EL2 program, partnering closely with engineering, flight test, government and commercial stakeholders, and company leadership to ensure the tour achieves its strategic objectives safely, on schedule, and within budget. &lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;After the completion of the European tour this role will transition to supporting EL9. &amp;nbsp;The exact nature of this support will depend on the candidates specific skills and interest areas; likely options include test team program management, program office support, or leading teams executing government contract&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tour Planning and Strategy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop a master schedule, budget, and resourcing plan for the tour, including aircraft transport/ferry logistics, ground support, and personnel deployment to meet the overall mission objectives and success critera.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Sales, Business Development, and Government Affairs to prioritization of target locations, stakeholders, and events (e.g., customer demonstrations, government engagements, airshows) across the tour itinerary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-Functional Coordination&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Flight Test and Engineering teams to ensure the aircraft, crew, and support equipment are mission-ready for each tour stop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Legal, Regulatory, and International Trade/Export Control functions to secure necessary permissions, airspace access, and customs clearances for international operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Serve as the central point of coordination between internal teams and external partners, hosts, and government counterparts at each location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage vendor and logistics partners supporting ground operations, transport, and lodging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Risk Management and Execution&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify, track, and mitigate risks related to schedule, safety, logistics, weather, and geopolitical factors across tour locations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop contingency plans for schedule disruptions, maintenance needs, or changes in stop-level objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Monitor tour execution in real time and adjust plans as needed to maintain safety and achieve strategic goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain clear documentation and traceability of decisions, approvals, and changes throughout the tour&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reporting and Communication&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Provide regular status updates to program and executive leadership on tour progress, risks, and outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Capture and communicate lessons learned and stakeholder feedback from each tour stop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Support internal and external communications/marketing efforts related to the tour&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver a post-tour summary with key outcomes, metrics, and recommendations for future campaigns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Business, or related field, or equivalent experience (advanced degree a plus)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;US Persons required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;8+ years in program or project management, ideally within aerospace, defense, or a related complex technical industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven track record managing complex, multi-stakeholder programs with tight schedules and significant logistical coordination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with international operations, export control considerations, and cross-border logistics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong organizational and risk management skills, with the ability to adapt plans quickly in dynamic environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to work cross-functionally with engineering, flight test, legal, and business teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, including experience engaging with government and/or customer audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Willingness and ability to travel internationally, potentially for extended periods&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting flight test campaigns, demonstration tours, or airshow operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with European aviation regulatory environments and airspace coordination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with government or defense customers internationally&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prior experience with aircraft ferry/transport logistics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance; STD, LTD, and life insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, sick leave, and company holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Paid winter break&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;401(k) with immediate vesting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Free catered lunches, coffee, snacks, and drinks at our Manassas headquarters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Free on-site parking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Electra is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. This position may be subject to ITAR requirements.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗠𝗮𝗸𝗲𝘀 𝗖𝗹𝗼𝘂𝗱𝗯𝗲𝗱𝘀 𝗨𝗻𝗶𝗾𝘂𝗲&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cloudbeds.com/&quot;&gt;Cloudbeds&lt;/a&gt;, we&#39;re not just building software, we&#39;re transforming hospitality. Our platform powers hotels across 150 countries, processing billions in bookings annually. From boutique properties to large hotel groups, we help hoteliers transform operations and uplevel their commercial strategy through a unified platform that integrates with hundreds of partners. And we do it with a completely remote team. Imagine working alongside global innovators to build AI-powered solutions that solve hoteliers&#39; biggest challenges. Since our founding in 2012, we&#39;ve continually been recognized for excellence, most recently earning top honors at the 2026 HotelTechAwards for Best Hotel Management Software and landing on Deloitte&#39;s Technology Fast 500 again, but we&#39;re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗟𝗼𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗛𝗼𝘄 𝗬𝗼𝘂&#39;𝗹𝗹 𝗠𝗮𝗸𝗲 𝗮𝗻 𝗜𝗺𝗽𝗮𝗰𝘁:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an 𝗔𝗰𝗰𝗼𝘂𝗻𝘁 𝗠𝗮𝗻𝗮𝗴𝗲𝗿, you will be part of the Customer Success team. AMs will be expected to actively manage a portfolio of customers with an estimated value of $500,000 - $1,000,000 USD with the goal of building strong customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AM Team is responsible for identifying upsell opportunities for ACV expansion and minimizing customer churn. AMs will act as the first point of contact for all things related to Cloudbeds. They are responsible for guiding clients through their customer journey while providing recommendations on how to best improve their business in order to achieve success. As an AM you will make the motto &quot;more reservations, happier guests&quot; a reality by providing strategic guidance to our customers around the world and helping them achieve their &quot;Success Outcomes.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗬𝗼𝘂 𝗕𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝘁𝗼 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗧𝗲𝗮𝗺:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the customer&#39;s &quot;success outcomes&quot; and work with them to achieve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main point of contact for all things related to Cloudbeds and help escalate urgent support tickets, amongst other things&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve net dollar retention goals through identifying upsell opportunities and implementing proactive churn reduction strategies in order to help Cloudbeds obtain net negative churn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use a consultative approach to drive product engagement, customer &quot;stickiness&quot;, and package growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze customer data to improve customer utilization and engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage customer escalations related to the strategic use of Cloudbeds software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek to promote the value of the product and identify new opportunities to upsell additional services and products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review customer complaints and concerns and seek to improve all aspects of the customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a detailed understanding of products and services, assist customers with questions, and suggest the best products for their needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather client feedback and requirements for future releases of the software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use training materials to keep up-to-date with the latest system updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a &quot;strategic partner&quot; to assigned portfolio of customers, utilizing hospitality industry knowledge to provide insight and recommendations to optimize product performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the hospitality industry - continuously staying updated on industry trends, strategies, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗦𝗲𝘁𝘀 𝗬𝗼𝘂 𝗨𝗽 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗦𝘂𝗰𝗰𝗲𝘀𝘀:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional ability to communicate and foster positive business relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of customers&#39; concerns and thoughts regarding the use of products, and the ability to troubleshoot as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to communicate, present, and influence credibly and effectively at all levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to clearly communicate &amp;amp; synthesize customer details (needs, feedback, concerns, opportunities, etc.) internally to multiple departments (Sales, Support, Product, Marketing, Design).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple projects at a time while paying strict attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent listening, negotiation, and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and able to thrive in a results-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural relationship builder with integrity, reliability, and maturity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in hyper-growth work environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time and project management skills; always looking to improve inefficient processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing accounts within the European hospitality market is a significant plus, given the concentration of customers in this region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both English and German is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#LI-PC1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗼𝗿𝗸 𝗔𝘂𝘁𝗵𝗼𝗿𝗶𝘇𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻: Please note that applicants must be currently authorized to work in the location where the position is located without requiring visa sponsorship. At this time, Cloudbeds is unable to provide sponsorship for work visas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝘁𝗼 𝗘𝘅𝗽𝗲𝗰𝘁 - 𝗬𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗝𝗼𝘂𝗿𝗻𝗲𝘆 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗨𝘀&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behind Cloudbeds&#39; revolutionary technology is a team redefining what&#39;s possible in hospitality. We&#39;re 650+ team members across 40+ countries, bringing together elite engineers, AI architects, world-class designers, hoteliers, and hospitality veterans to solve challenges others haven&#39;t dared to tackle. Our diverse team speaks 30+ languages, but we all share one language: a passion for innovation and travel. From pioneering breakthroughs in machine learning to revolutionizing how hotels operate, we&#39;re not just watching the future of hospitality unfold – we&#39;re coding it, designing it, writing it, and shipping it. If you&#39;re ready to work alongside some of the brightest minds in tech who are obsessed with using AI to transform a trillion-dollar industry, this is your chance to be part of something extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more online at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cloudbeds.com/&quot;&gt;cloudbeds.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗖𝗹𝗼𝘂𝗱𝗯𝗲𝗱𝘀 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cloudbeds.com/press/?press_type=company-news&amp;amp;news_category=awards&quot;&gt;𝗔𝘄𝗮𝗿𝗱𝘀&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Winner – Hotel Management Software | HotelTechAwards (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overall 10 Best Places to Work | HotelTechAwards (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overall Top 10 Hotelier&#39;s Choice | HotelTechAwards (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finalist – Property Management Systems (PMS) &amp;amp; Channel Managers | HotelTechAwards (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Most Loved Workplace® Certified (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deloitte Technology Fast 500 (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗗𝗶𝘀𝗰𝗼𝘃𝗲𝗿 𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗕𝗲𝗻𝗲𝗳𝗶𝘁𝘀:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote First, Remote Always&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PTO in accordance with local labor requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office stipend based on country of residency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development courses in Cloudbeds University&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to professional development, including manager training, upskilling, and knowledge transfer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗘𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘆𝗼𝗻𝗲 𝗶𝘀 𝗪𝗲𝗹𝗰𝗼𝗺𝗲 - 𝗔 𝗖𝘂𝗹𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲 𝗼𝗳 𝗜𝗻𝗰𝗹𝘂𝘀𝗶𝗼𝗻&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudbeds is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer that celebrates the diversity in our global team! We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudbeds is committed to the full inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, Cloudbeds will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations in the hiring process. We encourage deaf, hard-of-hearing, deaf-blind, and deaf-disabled individuals to apply. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process or to perform essential job functions, please contact our HR team by phone at (858) 201-7832 or via email at &lt;a ---------- Cloudbeds will provide an American Sign Language (ASL) interpreter where needed as a reasonable accommodation for the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To all Staffing and Recruiting Agencies: Our Careers Site is only for individuals seeking a job at Cloudbeds. Staffing, recruiting agencies, and individuals being represented by an agency are not authorized to use this site or to submit applications, and any such submissions will be considered unsolicited. Cloudbeds does not accept unsolicited resumes or applications from agencies. Please do not forward resumes to our jobs alias, Cloudbeds employees, or any other company location. Cloudbeds is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes/applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;The Airbnb Hotels team is a fun, fast-growing group leading Airbnb’s expansion into the hotel sector. Operating with an entrepreneurial spirit, this team combines the simplicity, product excellence, and guest-centered ethos that define Airbnb. This team’s mission is to deliver the smoothest, most intuitive hotel booking experience for guests, while helping hotels easily drive incremental bookings so they can focus on delivering the best hospitality. The ultimate aim is to help more people discover high-quality hotels, creating value for guests and our hotel partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Key Account Manager on the Hotels Enterprise team, you will own the commercial relationship with a portfolio of global and multinational hotel groups in your region. Your goal is to turn introductions into signed agreements then into live, healthy, growing inventory by increasing participation, bookings and revenue across Airbnb and HotelTonight. You will lead the account planning cycle with each partner, negotiate and renew commercial terms, and be the single point of contact between their executives and many Airbnb teams including Connectivity, Product, Legal and Market Management teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for the end-to-end lifecycle from prospecting, to acquisition, contracting, rollout and performance management&amp;nbsp; of Key Account partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute a global win-win strategy for your portfolio that drives value to all parties and position Airbnb as a top strategic partner across all distribution channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Through the creation of mutual account plans with your partners you will design clear actions which deliver on the Objectives and KPIs of Airbnb and our Key Account Partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate agreements with partners to unlock new opportunities for both parties &amp;amp; promote long term mutual success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data to make decisions and design projects to best expand and enhance availability and revenue through existing partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor &amp;amp; analyze over/underperformance, market trends, growth opportunities or anomalies and regularly communicate performance to Executives leveraging available production data and global market insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with partners to ensure that the partnership is held to the highest industry standards and that commercial agreements as well as operational SLAs are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop close working relationships with key internal teams and individuals to ensure that they&amp;nbsp; provide appropriate levels of support to these key partnerships and key enhancements are made to unlock revenue for the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular business reviews, formal presentations for internal and external purposes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to execute changes at scale while collaborating with Market Management as a subject matter expert in Key Accounts accounts to drive local property performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively contribute to the development and standardization of Enterprise team processes, playbooks, and best practices across the global function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of Travel IndustryAccount Management experience; including 5 years in a Key Account Manager role with at least 2 years&amp;nbsp; being responsible for a global partner base.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of executing on strategic priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in analyzing, structuring and negotiating complex deals that align across multiple business unit needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation skills with a proven ability to structure and close high-value, complex deals that establish long-term, strategic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable performing data analysis and making decisions based on the results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance time spent between strategic initiatives and operations while diving into the details when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and selling complex business solutions at the C-Suite level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence and the ability to effectively influence top leaders internally and within the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a passion for redefining travel, Airbnb, and being the best!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive self-starter able to prioritize and manage work autonomously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal/written communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel at least 50% of the time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Netherlands Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€82.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€102.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will own the agents, skills and standards that let a tribe of product builders move quickly on payments without the architecture fragmenting. Hotels take payments across regions and through providers that each behave differently, and Payment Interfaces exists to give customers one coherent payment experience on top of several PSPs. Embedded payments at this depth is rare among European SaaS companies, so the problems here are ones few engineers get to work on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a Staff Engineer in the Payment Interfaces team, part of the Fintech tribe. You will report to the Director of Product and Engineering, sit in the tribe’s leadership group, and work alongside product builders, other staff engineers and product managers. No one reports to you, so your influence comes from the architecture, tools and standards that other people choose to work in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team integrates several PSPs depending on region and conditions. When integrations drift apart, builders slow down and quality suffers. This role exists to keep them coherent by encoding what good looks like into tools and agents, so every builder meets the standard by default.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you would do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the tribe’s engineering agents, skills and context, and encode architectural standards, review logic and quality gates into them so the standard is met by default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build an AI first responder for customer tickets about payment issues, with clear rules for when it answers and when it hands over to a person.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay hands-on for the hardest technical problems: migrations, system-wide refactors and long-lived architecture decisions across PSP integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep Payment Interfaces integrations coherent as PSPs and regional requirements change, collaborating with builders who own their own work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach builders and fix off-standard outcomes at the cause, so the lesson sticks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency Level 4:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role, that means you build the AI systems the tribe works in, not only use them. You design the agents, skills and evaluations that builders rely on every day, make the engineering decisions about how they behave, and set the rules for when an AI answer can stand and when a person must step in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to “&lt;a href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/external/YWI5ZGUyMGQ3MjU2NGRmNjlkZGEyYTg2NTVmZGE0OTU&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/a&gt;” on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you would bring&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience integrating with payment service providers or payment processors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep engineering craft and architectural judgment, including a sense of what is worth codifying and what is a one-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Fluency Level 4 or the equivalent hands-on experience: you have built agents, skills, evaluations or tooling that other engineers use, and you can explain where human oversight stays non-negotiable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems mindset that turns hard-won knowledge into reusable architecture and tooling rather than documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with influence as your main way of getting things done, working with builders, product managers, principals and senior leaders without anyone reporting to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in hospitality, travel or another operationally complex B2B SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience publishing or speaking externally about your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of coaching other engineers and multiplying their effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€79.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€98.200 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 491 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 954 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£81,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£103,200 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Netherlands&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$86,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$104,700 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$91,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$114,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager to join our Agentic Search team, building the search and retrieval infrastructure that powers AI agents and LLM-based applications at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on IC role with real ownership. You will take full end-to-end responsibility over a core product area, from defining strategy through shipping and iterating based on real usage data. You will work within a small PM team reporting to the Director of Product, alongside engineering, design, and go-to-market, shaping how AI agents discover, retrieve, and act on web information in real time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The product serves both a developer-facing PLG motion and a growing enterprise customer base, so you will need to be equally comfortable digging into API design and search quality as you are running customer discovery calls and informing competitive positioning. We are looking for someone who can operate as a senior strategic partner, not just an executor, and who has the potential to grow into a principal-level PM over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re welcome to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;work hybrid from Tel Aviv, Israel.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW95146830 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW95146830 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW95146830 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a core product area end-to-end: strategy, roadmap, execution, and iteration based on real usage signals and customer feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive search quality and relevance improvements by working closely with engineering and research to define evaluation frameworks, benchmarks, and release criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with enterprise customers and developer users to validate ideas, understand pain points, and shape product-market fit across both PLG and enterprise motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the competitive landscape in agentic search and AI-powered retrieval, identifying shifts, threats, and opportunities that should inform product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with go-to-market teams (sales, solutions, growth) to ensure product positioning, ICP definitions, and enablement materials reflect product reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to product strategy as a senior voice on a small, high-impact team, challenging assumptions and bringing independent judgment to key decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product experiments and rapid iteration cycles, moving from hypothesis to prototype to production with clear success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience, with a meaningful portion in developer tools, API platforms, or search and retrieval infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of shipping products in fast-moving markets, working closely with engineering and design from concept through launch and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of LLMs, AI agents, and how search and retrieval systems fit into agentic workflows. Hands-on technical background is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in computer science, engineering, or a related field, with the ability to engage deeply with technical architecture and tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in ambiguity: you can context-switch between strategic thinking and tactical execution without losing the thread.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence cross-functional stakeholders and drive alignment without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication: you can explain technical concepts clearly to both engineers and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;It will be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;an added bonus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt; if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in search, information retrieval, NLP, or adjacent domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in API-first or developer-platform businesses with both PLG and enterprise motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership experience in a high-growth technology company, especially post-acquisition or startup-within-a-larger-org environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People management or mentoring experience (building the skills of other PMs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Buyer Domain at Vinted is dedicated to creating a seamless and highly engaging experience for our members as they search, discover, and purchase items. Our challenge is unique: unlike standard e-commerce, our peer-to-peer catalogue consists of hundreds of millions of entirely unique, single-inventory listings, with millions of new items uploaded daily. Connecting the right buyer with the perfect item in real-time is at the very core of Vinted&#39;s success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The CVP team owns the core platform and services that govern how content is geofenced, balanced, and surfaced across Vinted&#39;s growing international network of markets. We build robust systems and tooling that manage cross-border visibility, enabling smooth and gradual market connections (e.g., FR-DE, BE-FR-ES) while optimising key liquidity metrics like Sell-Through Rate (STR%) and Gross Merchandise Value (GMV) by balancing the content in multiple channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team works closely with Content Visibility Management, Search, and Recommender relevance teams to accelerate product development. Currently, we are driving the automation of content visibility experimentation &amp;amp; analysis. Rather than having different content channels independently re-implement visibility controls, we are building a unified platform to provide autonomy to Decision Scientists. In addition, we are highly contributing in growing new large markets such as the USA and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive technical execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and maintain highly scalable, reliable, and secure backend systems to ensure efficient content visibility and search mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide technical decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to and challenge the technical direction of our backend services, leading system design reviews and ensuring high-quality, maintainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale features globally:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement and shape A/B tested features that positively impact our 80+ million users. Code changes are rolled out instantly to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your services:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor and improve backend service performance and stability. The team owns and monitors service-layer measurements (SLIs, SLOs, etc.) and has an on-call rotation which you will participate in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead team-level initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and drive technical initiatives within the team, while collaborating on domain-wide integrations with other engineering teams (such as Search and Recommender relevance teams).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with engineering and product managers, analysts, and other stakeholders, facilitating clear communication within the team and across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to product direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical feasibility assessments, identify technical risks, and provide effort estimations to help shape our team&#39;s product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster engineering excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor, guide, and share knowledge with other engineers in the team to support their technical growth and promote collaborative best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have extensive experience in backend software engineering, with a proven track record of designing and building scalable, distributed, and highly available systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly proficient in backend development. We primarily use Go, Kotlin, Ruby, Python — while prior experience in these specific languages is beneficial, a strong foundation in modern backend engineering and a willingness to learn is what matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event streaming platforms like Kafka, Apache Flink, or others for real-time data processing and message queueing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record working with search engines, information retrieval and ranking optimisations technologies (e.g., Vespa, Elasticsearch, OpenSearch) is a high advantage. If not, we expect you to have a strong willingness and motivation to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are enthusiastic about AI technologies, use AI tools daily in your work, and proactively learn and experiment with how to adopt AI to boost engineering outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of continuous integration and deployment pipelines, with experience in tools like Jenkins for automating builds and deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability and monitoring tools (we use Grafana, Kibana, and others) to keep services healthy and define SLIs/SLOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with relational and in-memory databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with experience working with cross-functional peers (Product, Analytics, SRE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in mentoring other engineers, providing constructive feedback, and promoting engineering best practices within your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionTitle__ZlnGI&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily lunch allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An NS mobility card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionTitle__ZlnGI&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€76.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€104.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Als globale Unternehmensberatung mit Fokus auf die Finanzdienstleistungsbranche kombinieren wir bei Capco innovatives Denken mit einzigartigem Know-How. So divers wie unsere Mitarbeiter*, sind auch unsere Lösungen, die wir unseren Kunden anbieten. Bringe Dich ein und setze Deine Ideen bei Capco in die Tat um als…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Senior) GenAI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Frankfurt am Main, Düsseldorf oder Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Capco Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du bist uns wichtig! Daher bekommst Du einen persönlichen Coach an Deine Seite gestellt, der Dich individuell fördert und unterstützt. Zudem bieten wir Dir ein umfangreiches Trainingsangebot sowie anerkannte Zertifizierungen. Mit unserer Start-Up-Mentalität und unseren flachen Hierarchien, stehen Dir alle Möglichkeiten offen. Nach Feierabend hast Du bei Teamevents oder gemeinsamen Aktivitäten die Chance, Dein Netzwerk zu erweitern und Deine Hobbies mit Kollegen* zu teilen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capco Benefits Card mit monatlicher Gutschrift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike Leasing Programm und geförderte Gesundheitschecks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attraktives Mitarbeiterempfehlungsprogramm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitsmodelle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unser Office Management in der City in FFM, direkt am Opernplatz, hält immer Erfrischungen und Überraschungen bereit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Capco Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du entwirfst und implementierst skalierbare, einsatzbereite Python-Anwendungen. Dein Schwerpunkt liegt dabei auf GenAI, insbesondere auf großen Sprachmodellen (LLMs) und der Vektorsuche, um die Datenverarbeitung und Dokumentensuche zu optimieren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du setzt neuartige Techniken zur Dokumentenaufteilung und Einbettung ein, um optimale Suchleistungen und eine hohe Relevanz sicherzustellen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Entwicklung intuitiver Benutzeroberflächen erfolgt idealerweise mit Angular oder React, um eine nahtlose Integration in die Anwendungen zu gewährleisten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du integrierst GenAI-Technologien in Anwendungen und sondierst kontinuierlich neue Technologien und Methoden, um die Ergebnisse von Projekten zu verbessern&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In enger Zusammenarbeit mit Stakeholdern stellst du sicher, dass die Best Practices bei allen Aktivitäten eingehalten werden, um höchste Qualitätsstandards zu gewährleisten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Capco Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Über 5 Jahre Erfahrung in der Entwicklung von unternehmensgerechten, skalierbaren Python-Anwendungen mit nachweislicher Erfolgsbilanz in der Bereitstellung hochwertiger Softwarelösungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Über 1 Jahr Erfahrung in der Entwicklung und Bereitstellung von Kundenlösungen, die durch GenAI-Technologien unterstützt werden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in der Anwendung von großen Sprachmodellen und Vektorsuchtechnologien, mit der Fähigkeit, diese Werkzeuge zur Lösung komplexer Herausforderungen in der Datenextraktion und -analyse einzusetzen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nachgewiesene Erfahrung in der Anwendung verschiedener Architekturen und Methoden zur Extraktion, Aufteilung und Einbettung unstrukturierter Daten für optimale Suchergebnisse, was ein tiefes Verständnis für Datenverarbeitung und Optimierungstechniken für GenAI-Retrieval zeigt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nachgewiesene Erfahrung in der Anwendung verschiedener Ansätze zur Vermeidung von „falschen Positiven“ während des Retrieval-Prozesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kenntnisse in der Frontend-Entwicklung mit Angular oder React sind von Vorteil, mit der Fähigkeit, ansprechende Benutzeroberflächen zu erstellen, die AI-gestützte Anwendungen ergänzen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vertrautheit mit Cloud-Infrastrukturmanagement und -bereitstellung (Docker, Terraform, GitHub Actions) ist von Vorteil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kenntnisse in der Azure-Infrastruktur (Netzwerkressourcen, Überwachung und Beobachtbarkeit) werden ebenfalls als Vorteil angesehen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deine fließenden Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse sowie eine uneingeschränkte Mobilität im (inter-)nationalen Raum runden Dein Profil ab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bewirb Dich jetzt - alles was wir brauchen, ist Dein CV!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Capco Recruiting Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Wichtig ist nur, dass wir zueinander passen (m/w/d) #beyourselfatwork&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Standort: Frankfurt, Düsseldorf, Berlin, München (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Practice Area&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Banking &amp;amp; Payments | Anstellungsart: Unbefristet&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Begleite führende Finanzinstitute bei der Transformation moderner Zahlungsverkehrslandschaften.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco sucht engagierte (Senior) Consultants mit Leidenschaft für Payments Transformation und digitale Innovationen im Zahlungsverkehr. In dieser Rolle unterstützt Du unsere Kunden bei anspruchsvollen Transformationsprojekten entlang der gesamten Wertschöpfungskette moderner Payment-Lösungen – von der Business Analyse und Fachkonzeption über Testing bis hin zur Implementierungsbegleitung.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du arbeitest an der Schnittstelle zwischen Fachbereich und Technologie und erhältst Einblicke in moderne Payment-Architekturen, regulatorische Anforderungen und innovative Zahlungsverkehrslösungen innerhalb eines dynamischen und internationalen Umfelds. Dabei nutzt Du geeignete, freigegebene AI-Tools und AI-gestützte Workflows, um Analysen, Qualität und Produktivität zu unterstützen – stets mit menschlicher Beurteilung und unter Berücksichtigung geltender Responsible-AI-Leitplanken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du begleitest anspruchsvolle Beratungsprojekte im Zahlungsverkehr – von der Business Analyse und Fachkonzeption bis hin zu Testing und Implementierungsbegleitung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest an Transformationsprojekten rund um moderne Zahlungsverkehrsarchitekturen, regulatorische Anforderungen und innovative Payment-Lösungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest mit Kunden und Projektteams sowohl in klassischen Wasserfallprojekten als auch in agilen Delivery-Umfeldern zusammen und setzt freigegebene AI-Tools, Automatisierung und AI-gestützte Workflows dort ein, wo sie Geschwindigkeit, Qualität oder Erkenntnisgewinn verbessern können.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du übernimmst Verantwortung für eigene Themenbereiche bis hin zur Steuerung von Teilprojekten und kleineren Projektteams und stellst beim Einsatz von AI durch Review, menschliche Beurteilung und definierte Eskalationswege eine verantwortungsvolle Nutzung sicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du gestaltest interne Themen aktiv mit und unterstützt die fachliche, methodische und persönliche Weiterentwicklung innerhalb von Capco.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über ein erfolgreich abgeschlossenes Hochschulstudium sowie relevante praktische Erfahrung in Beratungsprojekten im Finanzdienstleistungsumfeld.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast großes Interesse an Payments sowie Kenntnisse relevanter Themen und Prozesse wie PSD3/PSR, SEPA Classic, Instant Payments, TARGET2, TIPS, Clearing &amp;amp; Settlement, Cash Management oder Correspondent Banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über ausgeprägte analytische und konzeptionelle Fähigkeiten und arbeitest teamorientiert sowie kundenfokussiert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über fließende Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse und bist bereit, abhängig vom Projekteinsatz im nationalen und internationalen Umfeld zu reisen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist neugierig auf neue AI-gestützte Arbeitsweisen und bereit, freigegebene AI- und Automatisierungstools verantwortungsvoll einzusetzen, Ergebnisse kritisch zu prüfen und geltende Leitplanken, Review- und Eskalationsprozesse einzuhalten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Von Vorteil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit komplexen Payments-Transformationsprogrammen oder der Weiterentwicklung von Zahlungsverkehrsarchitekturen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vertiefte Kenntnisse in einem oder mehreren Bereichen wie Instant Payments, Clearing &amp;amp; Settlement, Cash Management oder Correspondent Banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit regulatorischen Veränderungen im Zahlungsverkehr, beispielsweise PSD3/PSR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in der Steuerung von Arbeitspaketen, Teilprojekten oder kleineren Projektteams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erste praktische Erfahrung mit AI-gestützten Workflows, Generativer AI oder Automatisierung im Beratungs-, Banking- oder Payments-Umfeld.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arbeite an wirkungsvollen Projekten und Lösungen für führende Finanzinstitute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erlebe eine kollaborative, offene und unternehmerisch geprägte Beratungskultur mit flachen Hierarchien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nutze kontinuierliche Lern- und Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten, Trainings und Zertifizierungen für Deine persönliche und fachliche Entwicklung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Werde Teil eines Teams, das die Zukunft digitaler Finanzdienstleistungen aktiv mitgestaltet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestalte die digitale Transformation unserer Kunden im Finanzdienstleistungssektor mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir bieten Dir ein wettbewerbsfähiges, auf unsere Mitarbeitenden ausgerichtetes Benefits-Paket, das Dich in unterschiedlichen Bereichen Deines Berufs- und Privatlebens unterstützt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitsmodelle und hybrides Arbeiten je nach Projekteinsatz möglich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding und Dein persönlicher Coach und Buddy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike-Leasing-Programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wahlweise Capco Benefits Card mit monatlicher Gutschrift i.H.v. 44 EUR. oder Wellhub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regelmäßige Gesundheitschecks sowie Mental-Health-Kurse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Der PME-Familienservice bietet Unterstützung für alle Lebenslagen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kontinuierliches Feedback und Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten, z. B. über interne Trainings und Udemy Business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Großartige Firmenevents und After-Work-Veranstaltungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unbefristeter Arbeitsvertrag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomie, flache Hierarchien, Hands-on-Mentalität und schnelle Entscheidungswege.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein dynamisches, wachstumsstarkes und internationales Umfeld mit zahlreichen Möglichkeiten, Dich und Deine Talente einzubringen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inklusion bei Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir setzen uns dafür ein, unseren Recruiting-Prozess für alle Menschen zugänglich und unkompliziert zu gestalten. Wenn Du in einer Phase des Bewerbungsprozesses Anpassungen oder Unterstützung benötigst, lass es uns einfach wissen – wir helfen Dir gerne weiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir schätzen die individuellen Perspektiven und Beiträge jedes Menschen. Bei Capco sind wir überzeugt, dass Du am stärksten bist, wenn Du Du selbst sein kannst. Unsere #BeYourselfAtWork-Kultur fördert Individualität und Zusammenarbeit – eine Haltung, die unsere tägliche Zusammenarbeit mit unseren Kunden und untereinander prägt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
