&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW75414619 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW75414619 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233118,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233117,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;London, Hammersmith &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW75414619 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW75414619 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW75414619 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW75414619 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW75414619 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;3 days per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW75414619 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW47175962 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW47175962 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233118,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233117,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Occasional Travel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Firmware&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Metrea, our single core value is Rooted in Humility, and our four cornerstone attributes are Entrepreneurial, Systematic, Discerning, and Over-Deliver. These form what we call our Teammate Firmware. Just like technical firmware connects software and hardware, our Firmware is the constant interface between our mission and our people. It defines how we show up, how we work together, and how we solve complex problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team Firmware creates a web-like, hyper-collaborative, dynamically hierarchical way of working that helps us adapt quickly, communicate openly, and distribute decision-making to where expertise actually lives. It enables groups to self-organize around hard problems, shift fluidly as priorities evolve, and operate with the trust, curiosity, and discipline required in a complex mission space. This foundation allows us to deliver elegant, effective solutions and uphold our purpose: protecting our precious inheritance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Black Duck Software, Inc. helps organizations build secure, high-quality software, minimizing risks while maximizing speed and productivity. Black Duck, a recognized pioneer in application security, provides SAST, SCA, and DAST solutions that enable teams to quickly find and fix vulnerabilities and defects in proprietary code, open source components, and application behavior. With a combination of industry-leading tools, services, and expertise, only Black Duck helps organizations maximize security and quality in DevSecOps and throughout the software development life cycle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and build-out of cross-product data services for multiple product lines from one governed data plane.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the “customer data plane” model: canonical customer identifiers, shared dimensions, and consistent facts used across products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operationalize ingestion patterns for batch, streaming, and event data, with repeatable onboarding for new sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the operational playbook for data reliability: data contracts, quality checks, lineage, monitoring, and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and run access methods that make data usable: curated datasets, secure query interfaces, and product-ready data APIs where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Productize customer-facing data products (datasets, metrics, exports, and feeds) with versioning, documentation, and clear ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design data models that fit both operational systems (RDS) and analytics stores (columnar/OLAP), including performance and cost tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data products also power ML workflows: trusted training datasets, feature-ready outputs, and consistent definitions for decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable AI automation by delivering reliable, low-latency, governed data products that can be used safely in automated workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with product, engineering, and security stakeholders to align data products to roadmap priorities and customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the technical bar through architecture reviews, standards, and mentoring—while staying hands-on in key systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience building and operating production data platforms at scale, including on-call and operational ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills and strong Python skills, used to build pipelines, services, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience running cloud systems on AWS and Google Cloud (IaaS level: compute, storage, networking, IAM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with both operational databases (RDS-style) and analytics stores (columnar/OLAP), including performance tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data modeling ability, including schema evolution, conformed dimensions, and “one source of truth” metric definitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of delivering data products that other teams or customers depend on, with clear contracts and reliability expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to make sound engineering tradeoffs across latency, accuracy, cost, and security without creating brittle complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lakehouse patterns and open table formats (or similar), including governance and table maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with orchestration and streaming systems used in production (batch + real-time), and managing backfills safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ML data needs (training/serving splits, feature-ready datasets, evaluation datasets) and AI-adjacent workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building self-service data platforms (catalog, discoverability, access controls) used by multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated or security-sensitive environments, including retention, auditing, and data access controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work model, location &amp;amp; travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Belfast, UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports to: VP of Data Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work model: Hybrid (details TBD)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration hours: Flexible; overlap with UK and US time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel: Minimal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-SS1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Black Duck is an equal opportunity employer. We consider all applicants for employment without regard to race, color, national origin, religion, sex, gender identity or expression, age, disability, sexual orientation, veteran or military service status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. Black Duck complies with all applicable laws prohibiting employment discrimination in every jurisdiction where it operates and provides reasonable accommodations to individuals with disabilities in accordance with applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics is a leading global sports platform redefining how fans connect with the teams, players and moments they love. Our businesses — Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, Fanatics Events, Fanatics Advertising, Fanatics Markets and Fanatics Studios — maximize the presence and reach for hundreds of partners globally and create a one-stop experience that allows fans to buy, bet, collect, and earn, while engaging with sports in deeper, more immersive ways. This includes licensed fan gear and lifestyle products, sportsbook and iGaming, physical and digital trading cards, live events, premium sports entertainment content, credit card offerings and more. Together, they form a powerful, integrated ecosystem — connected by the Fanatics ONE loyalty program and FanCash, the currency of sport — delivering personalized experiences to over 100 million fans worldwide. Fanatics holds partnerships with over 900 sports properties, from professional leagues and players’ associations to teams, colleges and retail partners; over 7,000 athletes and celebrities; and over 2,000 retail locations, including all Lids stores. Backed by a team of more than 22,000 employees, Fanatics is committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Focus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Manager, Performance Creative Strategy at Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming (FBG), you are responsible for defining the strategic priorities, audience opportunities and learning agenda that shape Fanatics Casino performance creative. You’ll uncover the hooks, angles and player insights most likely to resonate, translate them into clear, inspiring briefs for the internal creative team, and track performance to understand what works and why. This role is the strategic link between player insight, creative development and performance results, ensuring the right problems are being solved and that learnings continuously inform future briefs across acquisition, engagement and retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position reports directly to the Senior Director, Performance Creative &amp;amp; GTM, and manages one Associate, Performance Creative.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Casino performance creative strategy across paid social, app networks, CTV, affiliates and lifecycle, aligned with business priorities, audience insight and brand positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve the Casino creative variation framework, mapping hooks, angles, reasons to believe, formats and offers to audience and funnel stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business objectives and player insight into clear, inspiring briefs for the internal creative agency, including scripts, hook variations and iteration briefs on winning concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Casino testing agenda, defining what we want to learn, how we measure a win, and which tests run each month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a high-velocity testing program across hooks, openers, formats, offers and creators, continuously improving hit rate and speed to learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Media and Analytics to track creative performance, identify winners and fatigue early, and apply learnings to the next round of briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write concise test readouts and maintain a living library of what works for Casino players.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and define the performance territories, audience tensions and messaging opportunities to support creative briefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed performance requirements into brand and full-funnel campaign briefs from the outset (in collaboration with integrated marketing and media), ensuring channel, audience, format and measurement needs are clear before creative development begins. Partner with the Casino Creative Studio to translate those requirements into effective creative, with the Studio retaining ownership of creative direction and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Brand and agency partners on hooks, edits, cutdowns, aspect ratios and platform-native versions, so big campaign moments carry through to always-on performance and lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source player insight, competitor ad libraries, creator content and platform trends to identify new angles and white space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead performance strategy/creative insight sessions and contribute a strong POV to creative brainstorms, working closely with the Casino Creative Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present performance learnings and recommendations in GTM forums and monthly reviews, turning results into a clear story for senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor and develop an Associate, building their craft in briefing, analysis and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How This Role Connects Across the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with the internal producer, who owns production timelines and delivery, to keep briefs, priorities and the content calendar aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with the Casino Creative Studio and Integrated Marketing to shape high-quality output, providing direction and feedback while respecting executional ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with Brand and Integrated Marketing to embed performance best practice into campaigns, ensuring work is both distinctive and built to perform across the funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with Media, Analytics and CRM to define success measures, read results and feed learnings back into strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with Legal, Compliance and Creative Operations to keep all creative compliant and aligned with Responsible Gaming standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the affiliates teams to produce UGC briefs aligned to channel best practice, adapting content that’s optimised for performance (via creative briefs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in creative strategy, performance creative or brand strategy, including 3+ years leading creative strategy for a fast-growing D2C brand, mobile app, gaming or casino business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio demonstrating hook-led, insight-driven creative and the performance results behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of platform-native creative across Meta, TikTok, YouTube, Snap and app networks, including UGC and creator formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record building and running creative testing programs at volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to read performance data, size results and translate them into clear recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent storytelling and writing skills, from a 6-second hook to a campaign narrative to an executive readout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing brand and integrated campaigns across matrixed teams without direct ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and developing direct reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally for team meetings and Fanatics events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, your interview and onboarding experience may include in-person components, such as onsite interviews or Launching into Better: LIVE—a multi-day cultural immersion in New York City for full-time, non-seasonal hires. These sessions are designed to build connection and bring our culture to life, though specific travel and participation requirements will be confirmed based on your role and location. Your recruiter will provide clear guidance at each stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#li-JM3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics is a leading global sports platform redefining how fans connect with the teams, players and moments they love. Our businesses — Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, Fanatics Events, Fanatics Advertising, Fanatics Markets and Fanatics Studios — maximize the presence and reach for hundreds of partners globally and create a one-stop experience that allows fans to buy, bet, collect, and earn, while engaging with sports in deeper, more immersive ways. This includes licensed fan gear and lifestyle products, sportsbook and iGaming, physical and digital trading cards, live events, premium sports entertainment content, credit card offerings and more. Together, they form a powerful, integrated ecosystem — connected by the Fanatics ONE loyalty program and FanCash, the currency of sport — delivering personalized experiences to over 100 million fans worldwide. Fanatics holds partnerships with over 900 sports properties, from professional leagues and players’ associations to teams, colleges and retail partners; over 7,000 athletes and celebrities; and over 2,000 retail locations, including all Lids stores. Backed by a team of more than 22,000 employees, Fanatics is committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Product Manager, Trading Product&lt;/strong&gt; at Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming (FBG), you’ll support the development and delivery of key features that power our pre-match and in-play betting experiences. You’ll work closely with product, trading, and engineering teams to improve how we manage and price markets - helping ensure a fast, reliable, and competitive offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a great opportunity for a product manager with strong collaboration skills, a passion for sports, and a desire to work on impactful, customer-facing features that directly influence what users see and bet on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the scoping and delivery of new trading product features and enhancements, helping manage a multi-team roadmap&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear product requirements and partner with engineering to deliver high-quality features efficiently&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with traders, risk teams, and operations to understand workflows and identify pain points&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor product and market performance to identify trends, flag issues, and recommend improvements&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and customer insights to support prioritization and validate feature impact post-launch&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct research on competitor offerings and industry trends to ensure strong market positioning&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate updates, decisions, and outcomes clearly to stakeholders across the business&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 years of product management or sports trading experience&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of sports — particularly how fans engage with live events and betting&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills; ability to clearly convey product ideas, specs, and decisions to a wide range of stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with engineers, analysts, and operational users to deliver cross-functional solutions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset and comfort using data to guide product decisions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI tools to support product research, analysis, requirements writing and prototyping, with sound judgement on when to use them and how to validate their outputs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, team-first mindset and strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-LS2&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ranges will change based on country and state of residence, which are reflected in Geographical Zones defined by Fanatics Betting and Gaming. The range incorporates all of our Geographical Compensation Zones and is subject to change as the Zone associated with the actual offer is confirmed. In addition to the base and bonus, full-time employment, and more. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£40,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£50,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
