&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PRO Entwicklung:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Förderung persönlicher und beruflicher Weiterentwicklung, internationale Karrieremöglichkeiten, gruppenübergreifende Karrierechancen, vielfältiges Schulungsangebot, Entwicklungsgespräche &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PRO Werte:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Offene Kommunikation, Du-Kultur, Teamgeist, Respekt, Wertschätzung, gemeinsame Team- und Firmenevents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PRO Extras:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Onboardingkonzept, Employee Assistance Service, Wellhub, &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;JobRad&lt;/span&gt;, Mitarbeiterangebote&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;betriebliche Altersvorsorge&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 78, 134);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;PRO YOU – Deine Stärken, Deine Karriere&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Wir freuen uns auf Deine Bewerbung und darauf, Dich kennenzulernen!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Für Deine Bewerbung benötigen wir nur Deinen Lebenslauf&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;Zeugnisse sind optional. Du kannst Deine Unterlagen gesammelt &lt;strong&gt;in einer Datei &lt;/strong&gt;über unser Online-Portal unter &lt;strong&gt;„Lebenslauf“&lt;/strong&gt; hochladen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nach Eingang Deiner Bewerbung erhältst Du eine Bestätigung, und wir melden uns so schnell wie möglich bei Dir zurück. Der nächste Schritt kann ein Vorabgespräch mit uns oder direkt ein erstes Kennenlernen mit dem Fachbereich sein. 99% der Erstgespräche finden online statt. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Fragen? Melde Dich – wir helfen gern!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;The Airbnb Hotels team is a fun, fast-growing group leading Airbnb’s expansion into the hotel sector. Operating with an entrepreneurial spirit, this team combines the simplicity, product excellence, and guest-centered ethos that define Airbnb. This team’s mission is to deliver the smoothest, most intuitive hotel booking experience for guests, while helping hotels easily drive incremental bookings so they can focus on delivering the best hospitality. The ultimate aim is to help more people discover high-quality hotels, creating value for guests and our hotel partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Key Account Manager on the Hotels Enterprise team, you will own the commercial relationship with a portfolio of global and multinational hotel groups in your region. Your goal is to turn introductions into signed agreements then into live, healthy, growing inventory by increasing participation, bookings and revenue across Airbnb and HotelTonight. You will lead the account planning cycle with each partner, negotiate and renew commercial terms, and be the single point of contact between their executives and many Airbnb teams including Connectivity, Product, Legal and Market Management teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for the end-to-end lifecycle from prospecting, to acquisition, contracting, rollout and performance management&amp;nbsp; of Key Account partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute a global win-win strategy for your portfolio that drives value to all parties and position Airbnb as a top strategic partner across all distribution channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Through the creation of mutual account plans with your partners you will design clear actions which deliver on the Objectives and KPIs of Airbnb and our Key Account Partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate agreements with partners to unlock new opportunities for both parties &amp;amp; promote long term mutual success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data to make decisions and design projects to best expand and enhance availability and revenue through existing partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor &amp;amp; analyze over/underperformance, market trends, growth opportunities or anomalies and regularly communicate performance to Executives leveraging available production data and global market insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with partners to ensure that the partnership is held to the highest industry standards and that commercial agreements as well as operational SLAs are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop close working relationships with key internal teams and individuals to ensure that they&amp;nbsp; provide appropriate levels of support to these key partnerships and key enhancements are made to unlock revenue for the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular business reviews, formal presentations for internal and external purposes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to execute changes at scale while collaborating with Market Management as a subject matter expert in Key Accounts accounts to drive local property performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively contribute to the development and standardization of Enterprise team processes, playbooks, and best practices across the global function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of Travel Industry Account Management experience; including 5 years in a Key Account Manager role with at least 2 years&amp;nbsp; being responsible for a global partner base.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of executing on strategic priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in analyzing, structuring and negotiating complex deals that align across multiple business unit needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation skills with a proven ability to structure and close high-value, complex deals that establish long-term, strategic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable performing data analysis and making decisions based on the results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance time spent between strategic initiatives and operations while diving into the details when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and selling complex business solutions at the C-Suite level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence and the ability to effectively influence top leaders internally and within the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a passion for redefining travel, Airbnb, and being the best!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive self-starter able to prioritize and manage work autonomously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal/written communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel at least 50% of the time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€84.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€105.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://createfuture.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;CreateFuture&lt;/a&gt; is a Version 1 company and &lt;strong&gt;AI-native consulting partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;where people do work that matters and are supported to do it well. We work alongside organisations such as PayPal, adidas, NatWest, FanDuel and Money Saving Expert, building digital products and services that make a difference&amp;nbsp; while always putting people first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of creators. We write code, shape delivery, build go-to-market strategies, develop AI solutions and create the practices that support our people. We work side by side with our clients, challenging what’s not working and helping them to build the future. Our commitment to craft, quality, and culture has helped us scale to over 600 people in just a few years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our UK Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;35 days leave (including bank holidays).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental and adoption leave.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial coaching + 5% pension match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40 hours of paid learning and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://2429507.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/2429507/CreateFuture%20Benefits%20(2026)%20(1).pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;View our full list of UK benefits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;CreateFuture is a&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1572759&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Great Place to Work-Certified™ company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and has won Best Workplaces UK multiple years in a row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us on our journey. Let’s create tomorrow, together, today.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;CreateFuture are looking for a collaborative and pragmatic Lead Product Manager to join our growing team and help us define and develop an exciting array of products over a variety of industries, technologies and domains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Product Managers are responsible for working with senior leadership, our internal design and engineering teams and our clients to help define and implement product strategies that are consistent with our clients’ vision. This can be from early stage research and market analysis through to development, delivery and iteration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As we rapidly scale, we’ve identified an exciting opportunity for a Lead Product Manager to help support our growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This person will be responsible for shaping and leading client engagements. We have a variety of clients across many industries all of whom look to us to provide leadership and guidance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will rapidly gain their trust and guide them toward a valuable customer focused outcome. To do this you’ll use your deep understanding of product management methodologies and a consistent application of good practice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will also be responsible for the wellbeing of a team of product managers. You will help embed good practice and coach your team in client management techniques and the application of product management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Does this sound like you? Do you have experience in developing Product Managers and a passion for the craft of Product Management? Do you have an empathetic leadership style with a focus on coaching each person to help grow their career and skills? If so, we’ve got a great role for you to stretch your wings and see what you’re really capable of.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reporting into the Head of Product Operations and be able to represent the team as we grow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Leading a team of Product Managers and support recruitment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Helping embed and support career progression pathways using our development framework for personal growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Providing support to the team through mentorship and coaching&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Acting as an escalation point for the team, helping to remove internal and external blockers as needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Supporting resourcing of Product Managers on projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Identifying training and development needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Lead clients through their digital transformation journey, ensuring long term lasting relationships are made with key decision-makers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Working with the team to improve, shape and structure the Product Management ways of working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Passionate about Product Management as a discipline and keen to keep up to date on emerging trends, as well as experimenting with new tools and techniques&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Recent relevant experience of leading product focused engagements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Knowledge and experience of Product Management frameworks and approaches for continuous discovery and delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Have experience of product research and collecting evidence to support value propositions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a digital transformation and AI consultancy, delivering technology solutions to enterprise clients.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience applying AI to products, services or delivery, with a good understanding of how AI can create value for clients.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring, coaching and developing Product Managers and supporting the growth of product capability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Have experience of using data to help drive decisions and steer the direction of the product towards the client’s north star&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of web and mobile technologies and practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience leading or supporting&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;client discovery, workshops and product strategy, translating business needs into digital solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Be comfortable with ambiguity and help provide clarity in all situations&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;C09EB214JQN-1787053784.111639-thread-list-Thread_1787056669.790799&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We’re particularly interested in people who are curious about how AI is changing the craft of Product Management and are actively exploring what that means in practice.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bonus points if you:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience shaping or delivering AI-enabled products, services or propositions, from early discovery through to live products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the opportunities and limitations of LLMs, generative AI and agentic systems, and can translate these into meaningful customer and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experimented with AI-native product development, using AI to accelerate research, discovery, prototyping, analysis, documentation or decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can identify where AI agents or automation could change a customer journey, business process or product experience, rather than simply adding AI features to an existing product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand some of the new product considerations AI introduces — including evaluation, trust, human oversight, data, governance and responsible AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are proactive about new AI capabilities, tools and ways of working, and enjoy helping others build their confidence and capability too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You don’t need to arrive as an AI expert. If you haven’t yet had much opportunity to put AI into practice, that shouldn’t stop you applying. What matters to us is curiosity, a willingness to experiment and excitement about how AI is changing products and the craft of Product Management. Everyone at CreateFuture undertakes AI-native training, and we’ll support you to build these capabilities and put them into practice.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at CreateFuture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://createfuture.com/&quot;&gt;CreateFuture&lt;/a&gt; is an &lt;strong&gt;AI-native consulting partner &lt;/strong&gt;where people do work that matters and are supported to do it well. We work alongside organisations such as PayPal, adidas, NatWest, FanDuel and Money Saving Expert, building digital products and services that make a difference&amp;nbsp; while always putting people first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of creators. We write code, shape delivery, build go-to-market strategies, develop AI solutions and create the practices that support our people. We work side by side with our clients, challenging what’s not working and helping them to build the future. Our commitment to craft, quality, and culture has helped us scale to over 600 people in just a few years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our UK Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;35 days leave (including bank holidays).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental and adoption leave.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial coaching + 5% pension match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40 hours of paid learning and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-uZ_KOuW1SI-xoZ0Sd0WJCisULzkYox4/view?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;View our full list of UK benefits.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;CreateFuture is a&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1572759&quot;&gt; Great Place to Work-Certified™ company&lt;/a&gt; and has won Best Workplaces UK multiple years in a row.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us on our journey. Let’s create tomorrow, together, today.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced senior DevSecOps Engineer to join our growing Security practice. In this role you will drive Platform and application security across client engagements — embedding security thinking into every stage of the SDLC, mentoring engineers, and helping CreateFuture build world-class DevSecOps capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our clients span regulated and high-stakes industries including iGaming, healthcare-tech, e-commerce, and financial services. You will work hands-on with these clients — conducting threat modelling, secure architecture reviews, and penetration testing — while also shaping the internal AI-powered security tooling that sets CreateFuture apart.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Security – Design and implement security controls across Azure using Terraform (including Azure Entra ID, PIM, CAP, Policy Defender, and Sentinel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application Security – Incident Response plans, design and implement SAST, DAST, IaC, Container scans with industry-standard tools and deal with common issues such as False Positive rates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Threat Modelling &amp;amp; Secure Design – Lead threat modelling sessions and carry out secure architecture and code reviews on client engagements, including within regulated iGaming environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Penetration Testing – Perform white-boxed application and infrastructure pentesting across client projects, identifying vulnerabilities and delivering clear, actionable remediation guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security Incident Handling – Assist with and senior security incident response activities, coordinating across engineering teams and senior stakeholders to contain, investigate, and remediate incidents effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vulnerability Remediation &amp;amp; Validation – Conduct impact analysis and drive end-to-end remediation for application and infrastructure findings—including firewall configurations, system patching, and Entra ID administrative controls—while executing retesting and coordinating cross-functional regression testing to ensure seamless operational continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-Powered Security Tooling – Build and evolve AI-driven security tooling using Claude Code skills, hosted agents via StrandsAgent, and AWS AgentCore (or Azure equivalent) — automating security workflows and increasing coverage at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Governance – Perform compliance analysis, identify security requirements, and implement controls aligned to regulatory standards on client projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring &amp;amp; Onboarding – Coach and onboard DevSecOps engineers, and development teams on modern security practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Communication – Present security posture, risk findings, and remediation roadmaps clearly to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production experience operating in a multi-region Azure environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a senior DevSecOps / Application Security engineering role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working in SDLC as Dev, Quality engineer or DevOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working in a consulting setting and mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong infrastructure-as-code skills, particularly Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure security experience (Entra ID, PIM, CAP, Policy, Defender, Sentinel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with CI/CD security integration (Azure DevOps, GitHub Actions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of OWASP frameworks, secure SDLC, and application security assessment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting or coordinating penetration testing and threat modelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with secure code and architecture review, ideally in regulated or high-compliance environments such as iGaming, fintech, or healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on involvement in security incident response and handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with how the infosec team operates, including GRC, TPRM and SOC capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with common SIEM and SOAR platforms, their workflows and underlying data structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp; with&amp;nbsp; compliance and regulatory analysis (GDPR, PCI DSS, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI-powered security tooling using Claude Code, StrandsAgent, AWS AgentCore, or similar agentic frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in iGaming, lottery, or other highly regulated digital sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Azure | Terraform | GitHub Actions | Azure DevOps | JavaScript | C# | Java | .NET | React Native | Node.js | Claude Code | OWASP ZAP | Burp Suite | Sentinel | Defender&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have an exciting opportunity for an engineer within our AI &amp;amp; Algorithms department. As a PhD AI &amp;amp; Algorithms Engineer, you’ll work within our team of talented engineers and scientists on a diverse range of projects. With cutting-edge labs and computing resources at your disposal, you&#39;ll use technology to solve problems in the real world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This placement has a flexible start date across 2026 or 2027, and is suitable for PhD students who have recently graduated or are due to graduate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building intelligent systems, developing your skills through hands-on coding and training/testing models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learning software development skills in mixed-discipline teams, attending stand-ups and contributing to planning sessions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contributing to our internal research and development programs, building on state-of-the-art literature to produce our own, market-leading solutions and compelling demonstrations that showcase our expertise to clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting projects for our clients to solve real-world problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communicating the results of your work to your colleagues and clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone with strong academic credentials and a PhD in a relevant technical subject, such as AI/machine learning, computer science, mathematics, physics or theoretical physics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in applying AI and algorithmic techniques to real-world problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python programming skills and appreciation for modern software development practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable research experience in a data-driven field (such as project work, conference proceedings or papers published in scientific journals).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While not essential requirements, we would also be very interested if you have experience with any of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Information science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bioinformatics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reinforcement learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transformer, diffusion models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Robotics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Edge compute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Some projects at Cambridge Consultants are subject to security restrictions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;This role requires you to obtain a Security Check level security clearance (&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/guidance/united-kingdom-security-vetting-applicant&quot;&gt;https://www.gov.uk/guidance/united-kingdom-security-vetting-applicant&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;). You must be able to work in the UK without restrictions in accordance with UK National Law and be prepared to successfully undertake an appropriate level of UK National Security Vetting according to UK Government National Security Vetting criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting an application to Cambridge Consultants, you confirm that the information provided in this application, together with any supporting documentation, is true, complete, and accurate to the best of your knowledge and belief. You understand that any false statement, misleading information, or material omission may render you liable to disqualification from the recruitment process, withdrawal of any offer of employment, or dismissal without notice if discovered following appointment. You acknowledge that the organisation reserves the right to verify the information supplied.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an Agentic Systems Engineer, to work on systems that haven&#39;t existed before. Think of an Agentic Coach that navigates the unpredictability of human biology, or the software architecture behind a fully automated Dark Lab. These aren&#39;t chatbots waiting for questions. They&#39;re proactive systems that maintain world models, interpret human intent, and intervene before the user knows to ask. These systems create genuine impact for clients tackling complex problems at the forefront of technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building them means designing and wiring agent harnesses: layered architectures that span from sensor-edge reasoning to high-level planning, backed by stateful multi-turn reasoning, persistent per-user memory, and robust evaluation pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work in two directions at once. Internally, you&#39;ll use the latest AI tools to sharpen how we build, prototype, and ship. Externally, you&#39;ll deliver the breakthrough systems our clients deploy, designed to move from prototype to production at pace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There&#39;s no single technology stack. You&#39;ll work with agents, multi-agent systems, and the latest generative AI tools, but your work will always be grounded in solid software engineering. Expect to build scalable distributed systems in core languages like Python and TypeScript, leveraging frameworks such as NextJS and Pydantic, agent orchestration tools (LangGraph, CrewAI), and protocols like MCP. You&#39;ll deploy on cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure) using Docker, Kubernetes, and infrastructure-as-code, backed by rigorous CI/CD and observability (OpenTelemetry, Prometheus).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Due to the clients we work with, you must be eligible for UK security clearance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI System Architecture: Designing and implementing the logic for autonomous systems, including maintaining world models, integrating multimodal sensing, and building real-time human-machine interaction loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Production Engineering: Designing the underlying software for scalable, secure, and observable cloud deployments. You will apply the engineering rigor required to take experimental AI from concept to robust live launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapid Client Prototyping: Driving a demo-first delivery model. You will focus on fast experimentation to actively show tangible value and working software to clients, while maintaining the engineering standards required for production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain Translation &amp;amp; Integration: Partnering directly with deep-tech subject matter experts (like biologists and roboticists) to apply software solutions to complex physical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agent Evaluation &amp;amp; Optimisation: Developing frameworks to measure, monitor and improve agent performance. You will design evaluation strategies, identify failure modes, and apply systematic testing to ensure agents are reliable, predictable and effective in real-world environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to succeed:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applied AI Expertise: You have hands-on experience building LLM-based agentic systems, with a solid grasp of the fundamentals: planning, reasoning, tool use, memory and orchestration. You know how to evaluate and monitor agents so you can measure how they perform in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core Software Fluency: You possess strong programming skills, good testing and deployment practices, and practical experience in cloud engineering, containerisation, and modern DevOps. You can design scalable, resilient systems, and you know that great agents still require excellent software engineering foundations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigating Ambiguity: You are comfortable working with uncertainty and evolving requirements. You break complex, ill-defined problems into clear, logical steps. You recognise that requirements evolve as new information emerges and can make sound engineering judgements about when rapid experimentation is appropriate and when a more rigorous approach is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: You communicate complex technical concepts clearly and confidently, adapting your style to different audiences. You are comfortable engaging with clients, engineers, scientists and business leaders, ensuring technical insights translate into meaningful decisions and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration and Influence: You know how to challenge constructively, influence through evidence and insight, and help others navigate trade-offs in fast-moving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem Solving: You enjoy tackling complex technical challenges and can quickly distil ambiguity into actionable plans. You combine analytical thinking with pragmatism to identify the right solution and move projects forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some projects at Cambridge Consultants are subject to security restrictions. This role requires you to obtain a Security Check (SC) level security clearance &amp;nbsp;( &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/guidance/united-kingdom-security-vetting-applicant&quot;&gt;United Kingdom Security Vetting: Applicant&lt;/a&gt; ). You must be able to work in the UK without restrictions in accordance with UK National Law and be prepared to successfully undertake an appropriate level of UK National Security Vetting according to UK Government National Security Vetting criteria.&amp;nbsp;Please be aware that, for roles requiring Security Check clearance, applicants will typically need to have been continuously resident in the UK for a minimum of 5 years immediately prior to applying for this role in order to meet the requirements for Security Check (SC) clearance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days annual leave plus bank holidays (with the option to buy 10 more a year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bonus (profit share)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working patterns and hybrid working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance and group income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee assistance programme and mental health support group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity/paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel insurance (business and leisure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous company pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personalised career development and training plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free subscription to professional bodies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast and two-course lunch in the office every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free onsite parking and we are close to public transport links&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A variety of events organised by our social committee, ranging from summer and Christmas parties to board game nights and socials at our own rooftop bar!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Cambridge Consultants?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cambridge Consultants, you&#39;ll contribute to radical, new-to-the-world innovation that transforms business, society and the planet. Joining our multidisciplinary teams means helping to turn bold ideas into reality, harnessing the power of deep tech to create products, services and experiences that have never existed before. Whether you&#39;re advancing technologies, shaping strategy, supporting operations or driving commercial growth, it&#39;s an opportunity to make a real impact and help create the future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting an application to Cambridge Consultants, you confirm that the information provided in this application, together with any supporting documentation, is true, complete, and accurate to the best of your knowledge and belief. You understand that any false statement, misleading information, or material omission may render you liable to disqualification from the recruitment process, withdrawal of any offer of employment, or dismissal without notice if discovered following appointment. You acknowledge that the organisation reserves the right to verify the information supplied.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
