&lt;li data-start=&quot;1326&quot; data-end=&quot;1389&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1328&quot; data-end=&quot;1389&quot;&gt;Track outcomes and ensure knowledge flows back to operations.&lt;/p&gt;
