&lt;li data-start=&quot;1625&quot; data-end=&quot;1696&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1627&quot; data-end=&quot;1696&quot;&gt;Create scalable runbooks, troubleshooting guides, and error catalogs.&lt;/p&gt;
