&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4309&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d728c954f6de&quot;&gt;Scripting skills (bash and basic Python) for log collection, triage automation, and simple reliability analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
