&lt;p&gt;To further strengthen our Legal Department in Munich, we are looking for an experienced, pragmatic and business-oriented &lt;strong&gt;Senior Legal Counsel (f/m/d) – Commercial Law&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will take ownership of the drafting, review and negotiation of a broad range of national and international commercial agreements across the Agile Robots Group. You will work closely with our Business, Engineering, Procurement and Management teams, providing practical legal advice on commercial transactions and projects involving robotics, hardware, software and industrial automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Legal Director Germany and join our Legal team in Germany, currently comprising four members. You will also collaborate with five additional Legal Counsel across the group internationally. This is a full-time, permanent position based in Munich, with the option to work remotely one day per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently draft, review and negotiate a broad range of complex national and international commercial agreements, including supply, procurement, sales, service, cooperation, development, licensing, software and technology agreements as well as NDAs, taking ownership from initial instruction through negotiation and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on complex project-related contracts and support cross-functional teams throughout the entire project lifecycle, including Proof-of-Concept and Proof-of-Technology projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address IP-related provisions in commercial, technology and development agreements, particularly licensing and the allocation of intellectual property rights, in collaboration with colleagues specializing in IP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted legal business partner for internal stakeholders across multiple jurisdictions and international group companies, proactively identifying legal and commercial risks and developing pragmatic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support legal matters across the group&#39;s international subsidiaries and acquired businesses, collaborating with other members of the Legal team on cross-functional matters as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain the group&#39;s commercial template library, negotiation playbooks and contracting processes together with internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a fully qualified German lawyer (&lt;em&gt;Volljurist&lt;/em&gt;) with strong academic credentials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least five years of post-qualification experience, including relevant experience in commercial contract law gained at a leading international law firm. Previous in-house experience, whether through an in-house role or a substantial secondment, is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have substantial hands-on experience drafting, reviewing and negotiating complex commercial agreements and are comfortable independently leading negotiations with sophisticated counterparties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising technology, software, hardware or industrial businesses, including IP-related contractual matters such as licensing and the allocation of intellectual property rights, is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent drafting, negotiation and communication skills, take ownership of your work and provide pragmatic, commercially oriented advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You combine professional excellence with a down-to-earth attitude, a sense of humor and a collaborative mindset, and are happy to support colleagues beyond your immediate area of expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in German and English and comfortable negotiating sophisticated commercial agreements in both languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; is a leading provider of AI-powered robotics solutions. By combining artificial intelligence and robotics, the company makes industries smarter, more flexible, and more efficient.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in Munich in 2018 by renowned robotics researchers from the German Aerospace Center (DLR), Agile Robots has experienced rapid global growth. Today, more than 3,500 highly skilled robotics and AI enthusiasts are employed worldwide. The company has one of the largest research and development teams in the AI and robotics industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agile Robots has built a unique portfolio; together with the subsidiaries BÄR Automation, Franka Robotics, idealworks, and Krause Automation, the company covers all areas of AI-driven robotics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more at: &lt;a id=&quot;menur58p&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Robotics &amp;amp; Mechatronics Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for a&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;C++ Software Engineer (m/f/d) Platform Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;, who will help build and maintain the C++ platform infrastructure our robot runs on. You will help us ensure it runs reliably and safely once it is out of the lab and in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and maintain modern C++ software components for the robot&#39;s Linux-based platform infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; IPC:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain the IPC and communication interfaces that connect robot applications, backend services, and hardware-facing components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Debugging &amp;amp; Diagnostics:&lt;/strong&gt; Debug concurrency, timing, memory, performance, and system-integration issues across the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Build unit, integration, and hardware-oriented test infrastructure for platform components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliability &amp;amp; Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve system reliability through better diagnostics, logging, fault handling, and recovery mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Test and integrate software on real robotic hardware, working with firmware, control, backend, QA, and DevOps engineers when problems cross those boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field, or an equivalent combination of training and experience, with initial professional experience building production C++ software, typically up to about three years and excluding internships or working-student positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern C++:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience writing C++ using modern practices (C++17/C++20), gained through professional work, internships, or substantial project experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Working understanding of Linux system programming — processes, threads, synchronization, IPC, and sockets — along with asynchronous programming concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Debugging:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical debugging experience using tools such as GDB, sanitizers (ASan/TSan/UBSan), or Valgrind, applied to problems that span multiple interacting software or hardware components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience writing automated tests with frameworks such as GoogleTest, including meaningful unit and integration test coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Robotics &amp;amp; Industrial Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with robotics, industrial automation, or embedded systems, including industrial communication protocols such as EtherCAT, CAN, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware-in-the-Loop Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with hardware-in-the-loop, simulation, fault-injection, or other automated system-testing approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embedded Linux:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with real-time or performance-sensitive Linux systems, or with the deployment side of embedded Linux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience using Python for testing, automation, or developer tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Assisted Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience using AI-assisted development tools, combined with critically reviewing and validating the generated output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; is a leading provider of AI-powered robotics solutions. By combining artificial intelligence and robotics, the company makes industries smarter, more flexible, and more efficient.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in Munich in 2018 by renowned robotics researchers from the German Aerospace Center (DLR), Agile Robots has experienced rapid global growth. Today, more than 3,500 highly skilled robotics and AI enthusiasts are employed worldwide. The company has one of the largest research and development teams in the AI and robotics industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agile Robots has built a unique portfolio; together with the subsidiaries BÄR Automation, Franka Robotics, idealworks, and Krause Automation, the company covers all areas of AI-driven robotics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more at: &lt;a id=&quot;menur58p&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role is based in &lt;strong&gt;Copenhagen&lt;/strong&gt;, Denmark. We welcome applicants open to relocate and eligible to work in Denmark.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Senior Value Engineer, you will spearhead AI and data-driven business transformation within the Pharmaceutical sector by contributing to your customer’s end-to-end value journey using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Lead and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As an AI-fluent operator, your core mandate is to orchestrate complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover the real issues by peeling back layers of organizational complexity. Own the Outcome from first discovery through realized ROI for your process areas. Tell the Value Story by crafting powerful executive narratives and leading business value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate powerful executive sponsorship across core business units to champion transformation programs. Co-own change management with customer leaders and design CoE roadmaps that build self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer Global Transformations across complex workstreams. Own and implement AI-driven account planning and AI-assisted project management. Automate executive governance (QBRs, SteerCos) with minimal manual friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI tools for rapid technical outputs while partnering with Applied Value Engineers for deep-dive solution builds. Champion platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strategic expansion roadmap embedding Celonis as a strategic platform to drive adoption. Provide feedback to R&amp;amp;D based on evolving customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience taking ownership of complex workstreams, process areas, and customer relationships in Value Engineering, Consulting, or Pre-Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid background in enterprise IT and business software (e.g., SAP, Workday, Salesforce, Oracle). You operate primarily as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI copilots to generate outputs and automations, avoiding heavy manual coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable setting your own direction within an account team. Driven to &lt;em&gt;live for customer value&lt;/em&gt;, proactively hunting and ideating for highest-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise in executing process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise orchestrating multi-region or business unit transformation programs. Expert at mobilizing VP/Director-level sponsorship. Flawless English communication with commanding executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Finance/Supply Chain domains and Pharmaceutical trends. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics,&amp;nbsp; comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-NS1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role is based on-site/hybrid in &lt;strong&gt;Copenhagen&lt;/strong&gt;, Denmark. We welcome applicants open to relocate and eligible to work in Denmark.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Senior Value Engineer, you will spearhead AI and data-driven business transformation within the Retail sector by contributing to your customer’s end-to-end value journey using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Lead and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As an AI-fluent operator, your core mandate is to orchestrate complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their [Core Functional Area] ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover the real issues by peeling back layers of organizational complexity. Own the Outcome from first discovery through realized ROI for your process areas. Tell the Value Story by crafting powerful executive narratives and leading business value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate powerful executive sponsorship across core business units to champion transformation programs. Co-own change management with customer leaders and design CoE roadmaps that build self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer Global Transformations across complex workstreams. Own and implement AI-driven account planning and AI-assisted project management. Automate executive governance (QBRs, SteerCos) with minimal manual friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI tools for rapid technical outputs while partnering with Applied Value Engineers for deep-dive solution builds. Champion platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strategic expansion roadmap embedding Celonis as a strategic platform to drive adoption. Provide feedback to R&amp;amp;D based on evolving customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience taking ownership of complex workstreams, process areas, and customer relationships in Value Engineering, Consulting, or Pre-Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid background in enterprise IT and business software (e.g., SAP, Workday, Salesforce, Oracle). You operate primarily as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI copilots to generate outputs and automations, avoiding heavy manual coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable setting your own direction within an account team. Driven to &lt;em&gt;live for customer value&lt;/em&gt;, proactively hunting and ideating for highest-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise in executing process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise orchestrating multi-region or business unit transformation programs. Expert at mobilizing VP/Director-level sponsorship. Flawless English communication with commanding executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Finance/Supply Chain domains and Retail trends. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics,&amp;nbsp; comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-NS1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
