&lt;p&gt;We believe that great work deserves great rewards. In return for your ideas, commitment and ambition, we’ll give you a very competitive base salary and a range of benefits as soon as you join. On top of your highly competitive base salary, we offer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prestigious sales and broader team recognition with Annual Presidents Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company equity incentive plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 days annual leave + plus bank holidays (increasing to 30 with length of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;½ day leave for your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical options at 5-years &amp;amp; 10-years’ service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 days study leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 day charity leave to work for a charity of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental leaves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Payroll giving to your favorite charity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching &amp;amp; mentoring opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional perks such as discounted gym membership, cycle scheme, EAP and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this all sounds great, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Joblogic Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1998,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic&lt;/strong&gt; is the UK’s #1 &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Management&lt;/strong&gt; (FSM) software platform. We are a global business with offices in the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;. Since our management buy-out in 2013, we have grown from &lt;strong&gt;~£500K &lt;/strong&gt;ARR to &lt;strong&gt;~£35M+ &lt;/strong&gt;ARR and expanded our team from 11 to 500+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about_the_role_0&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Product Manager with strong experience in Field Service Management (FSM), Facility Management, or operational workflow-driven SaaS products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager at Joblogic, you will play a key role in shaping the future of our platform by deeply understanding how service contractors operate and translating complex operational workflows into intuitive product solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with engineering, UX, customer-facing teams, and customers themselves to identify real-world operational challenges and build solutions that simplify the daily work of engineers, planners, helpdesk teams, and operations managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who enjoys solving real operational problems, working closely with users, and building workflow-driven B2B SaaS products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what_your_main_focus_will_be_1&quot;&gt;What your main focus will be&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead discovery with customers across&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;field service and facilities management operations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand and map operational workflows including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reactive maintenance jobs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planned Preventative Maintenance (PPM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scheduling and dispatch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field engineer mobile workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asset lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quote → job → invoicing journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You will be expected to:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex operational problems into clear product requirements and solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with UX designers to create intuitive workflows and product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and prioritise roadmap initiatives aligned with product strategy and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams to ensure solutions are practical, scalable, and deliver real operational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate product ideas through customer interviews, field research, and prototype testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor product adoption, workflow performance, and user behaviour to continuously improve features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal teams including Sales, Customer Success, and Support to ensure successful feature adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what_you_bring_2&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience as a Product Manager within B2B SaaS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Field Service Management, Facilities Management, or operational workflow-based software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating real-world operational processes into clear product logic and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery skills and ability to conduct customer interviews and uncover real problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating closely with UX designers and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to manage stakeholders and communicate product strategy clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured thinking and ability to break down complex workflows into scalable product solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in fast-moving product environments with multiple priorities and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;nice_to_have_points_3&quot;&gt;Nice-to-have points&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CAFM / FSM / CMMS software platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;scheduling engines or optimisation logic&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;mobile-first workflows for frontline users&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;API-driven platforms and system integrations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;data-driven operational analytics and reporting systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;remuneration_package_and_benefits_4&quot;&gt;Remuneration package and benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary based on experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work within a global SaaS product company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career progression opportunities as Joblogic continues to scale internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, product-focused and innovative working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company events and team activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development through Joblogic Academy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to internal training and product leadership mentoring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quotient is seeking an experienced, detail-oriented operational leader to run the management, process control, governance and quality leadership of its research tissue bank. Quotient&#39;s human tissue bank is the foundation of our proprietary high-resolution somatic genetics platform, which delivers insights into cellular and organ disease biology and discovers novel targets for the development of new medicines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead across the whole sample lifecycle, from procurement review and receipt through storage, use, reuse, transfer and disposal, and keep Quotient compliant with its Human Tissue Authority (HTA) research licence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Head of Research Strategy and Operations, you will work closely with the Director of Partnerships to check that proposed research fits the permissions and restrictions attached to each collection. You will also be the central point of coordination between laboratory teams, Facilities, Procurement and Logistics, Project Leads and Data Infrastructure, so that colleagues get timely access to suitable samples with full end-to-end traceability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines ownership of the tissue bank with practical oversight of delivery. Success means reliable, well-organised inventory and chain-of-custody records, timely availability of samples for research, compliance with internal SOPs and HTA regulations, and effective resolution of any sample-related incidents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Biobank governance and strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Own Quotient&#39;s research tissue bank strategy, aligning governance, capacity, resources and operating systems with the research portfolio, and recommend investment and improvements. Report sample availability, integrity, traceability, compliance risks and incident trends to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HTA compliance: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the HTA Designated Individual for Quotient&#39;s research licence, supervising licensed activities and making sure that staff, premises, storage and procedures meet HTA requirements. Develop SOPs, oversee training and competency assurance, and lead inspection readiness and responses, covering UK HTA, GDPR, research ethics and health and safety standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sample access and use authorisation: &lt;/strong&gt;Review access, initial use, reuse and onward transfer against consent, research ethics approvals, licence scope and contractual permissions, and document each decision. Apply independent judgement to complex sample-use decisions, balancing scientific priorities with donor permissions, sample availability and governance requirements, and obtain specialist advice or further approvals where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sample acquisition and custody: &lt;/strong&gt;Own custody controls from handover at receipt through registration, storage, retrieval, distribution and disposal, including manifests, shipment conditions, acceptance checks, handovers and receipt acknowledgements. Set requirements for human tissue shipments and approve the release of inbound and outbound shipments, working with logistics colleagues who handle couriers and documentation. Provide cover for sample receipt and shipping, directly or through trained delegates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory systems and traceability: &lt;/strong&gt;Integrate sample inventory with LIMS and ELN records, keeping identifiers, parent–derivative relationships, quantities, locations, status and movement histories accurate through timely updates, controlled access and periodic reconciliation. Ensure accurate annotation and metadata for all biospecimens, work with the Data Infrastructure team to bring sample data into research pipelines, and report on utilisation, inventory status and operational metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Storage integrity and continuity: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage storage organisation and capacity with laboratory and facilities colleagues. Work with the team that owns the temperature-monitoring system to make sure it is fit for purpose and supports HTA compliance, sign off monitoring procedures and the training of staff who use it, and check calibration and alarm-test records as part of routine internal audits. Own specimen decisions during alarms and recovery, including integrity assessment, transfers, holds and incident recording, and agree documented default actions so that out-of-hours response does not wait for a specimen decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident resolution and corrective action: &lt;/strong&gt;Escalate concerns, pause non-compliant activities and hold samples where eligibility, documentation or integrity is unresolved. Run a quality-driven incident process, track corrective and preventive actions and approve closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capability and culture: &lt;/strong&gt;Build capability through coaching, knowledge sharing and effective cover arrangements across the biobank and sample-management network. Create an environment where colleagues raise concerns, learn from incidents and share accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are an experienced biobanking or human tissue governance leader who combines sound regulatory judgement with practical delivery. You can make and explain proportionate decisions, influence across functions and build quality-based systems that support a growing research portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc in Biological Sciences, Biomedical Sciences or a related discipline, or equivalent relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More than 5 years working with human biological samples in a research, biotechnology, biobank or clinical laboratory setting, including leadership of sample governance and operations across the sample lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated leadership, including setting direction, developing colleagues and capability, influencing senior stakeholders without direct authority, and resolving competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across a variety of quality systems, and able to interpret guidelines and apply basic principles in a research setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing consent, ethics and provenance documentation, interpreting sample-use restrictions, and assessing proposed use, reuse and transfer in collaboration with scientific, partnerships and legal colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing sample-related provisions in MTAs, SLAs, MSAs or equivalent agreements and translating those obligations into operational controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ownership of sample accessioning, chain of custody, storage, database inventory and distribution processes, with practical experience of LIMS, ELN or comparable systems and their data quality and access controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of the Human Tissue Act 2004, HTA research licensing and relevant standards, with experience supporting or leading licensed activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing controlled documentation, training staff, preparing for audits or inspections, and leading incident investigations, corrective and preventive actions and documented closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisational skills, attention to detail and professional judgement, with a commitment to donor respect, confidentiality, scientific quality and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous appointment as an HTA Designated Individual, or substantial experience as a Person Designated with responsibility for tissue governance, inspections and compliance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with handling low-complexity clinical data and associated regulatory frameworks (GDPR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in genomics, molecular biology or high-throughput research, including support for histology, flow cytometry or molecular workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cryogenic storage, freezer monitoring, sample integrity assessment and business continuity arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge or experience of REC applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating domestic and international sample transfers, external biobanks, offsite sample storage companies or CROs, and working with third-party logistics teams within a growing biotechnology organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing colleagues or leading a biobank or sample reception team, and implementing inventory platforms or significant process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of building or improving tissue bank processes and systems, planning capacity and resources, and balancing scientific delivery with ethical and regulatory responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Quotient:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quotient Therapeutics is a privately-held, early stage company developing breakthrough medicines informed by natural somatic genetic diversity present in patients. Through our work in somatic genomics, we are forging a new status quo for biopharma research and development across a broad pipeline of internal and partnered programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The company was founded by Flagship Pioneering, an innovative enterprise that conceives, creates, resources, and grows first-in-category life sciences companies. Flagship Pioneering has created over 100 groundbreaking companies over the past twenty years, all of which are pioneering novel and proprietary biological, industrial, and engineering approaches to solve major needs in human health and sustainability. These companies include Moderna (MRNA), Generate Biomedicines, Sana Biotechnology (SANA), Tessera Therapeutics, Evelo Biosciences (EVLO), Indigo Agriculture, Seres Therapeutics (MCRB), and Syros Pharmaceuticals (SYRS).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quotient Therapeutics and Flagship Pioneering are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or Veteran status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment &amp;amp; Staffing Agencies:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quotient Therapeutics (“Quotient”) and Flagship Pioneering (“FSP”) do not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than candidates. The submission of unsolicited resumes by recruitment or staffing agencies to Quotient, FSP or their employees is strictly prohibited unless contacted directly by Flagship Pioneering’s internal Talent Acquisition team. Any resume submitted by an agency in the absence of a signed agreement will automatically become the property of FSP, and FSP will not owe any referral or other fees with respect thereto.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Notice for Applicants:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;When you apply for a role at Flagship Pioneering or one of its portfolio companies, we collect and use personal information you provide (such as your name, contact details, work history, and application materials) to evaluate your application, communicate with you, and comply with legal obligations. Your application data is processed through Greenhouse, our applicant tracking system, and may also be reviewed using AI-assisted screening tools. We do not sell your personal information. California residents have rights under the CCPA/CPRA including to know, delete, and opt out of the sharing of their personal information. If you are located in the EU or UK, we process your data under GDPR and you have rights to access, rectify, and erase your data. To exercise your rights or for questions, contact -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Senior Social Commerce Strategist needed to join our Global Social Commerce Team on a permanent basis.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for a commercially minded Senior Social Commerce Strategist to join our Global Social Commerce Team. This is a senior role for someone who thinks like an operator as much as a strategist: you will own the strategic and commercial thinking behind how some of the world’s biggest brands build, launch, trade and scale on social – with TikTok Shop at the centre – and you will be accountable for the quality of that thinking in front of senior clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will translate client business objectives into social commerce strategies that hold up commercially: channel economics that work, forecasts that are defensible, measurement that proves incrementality, and operating models that can be exported market to market. You will be the connective tissue between strategy, creative, media, data and platform partners – and the person clients call when they need a point of view on where social commerce goes next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will also lead people: line-managing a small team of strategists, setting the standard for the craft, and raising the commercial literacy of everyone around you. Depth across the social platforms and their commerce ecosystems – TikTok Shop above all, alongside Meta, YouTube and emerging AI-led discovery – is essential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Commercial strategy &amp;amp; value creation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Channel Economics &amp;amp; Business Case:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Build and own the commercial case for social commerce investment – channel P&amp;amp;L modelling, unit economics (COGS, commission, fulfilment, returns, promotional depth), contribution margin and payback – so recommendations are grounded in what actually makes money for the client.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Trading &amp;amp; Forecasting:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Set and pressure-test the numbers behind the plan: GMV, AOV, conversion, basket and attach rate, CAC, ROAS/MER and repeat rate. Build forecasts and scenario models across always-on trading, LIVE, affiliate and peak moments, and diagnose performance against them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Investment &amp;amp; Mix Strategy:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Advise clients on where budget works hardest across paid, organic, affiliate/creator and platform tooling (GMV Max, Spark Ads, retail media), making the trade-offs explicit – including what to stop doing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Margin &amp;amp; Pricing Discipline:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Protect client margin as volume scales – promotional architecture, discount dependency, bundling and pack strategy, and repeat-purchase mechanics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strategic leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Channel &amp;amp; Category Strategy:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Develop social commerce strategies aligned to client business objectives and category dynamics – defining role of channel, audience and demand strategy, portfolio and SKU selection, and the route from discovery to conversion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Operating Model &amp;amp; Market Expansion:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Design the operating model that makes the strategy deliverable – crawl/walk/run sequencing, roles and responsibilities across client, agency and platform partners, governance, and blueprints that export into new markets rather than being rebuilt each time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Launch &amp;amp; Commerce Readiness:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Own the go-to-market gate: fulfilment and 3PL models, dispatch SLAs, customer service, returns and Shop Health – ensuring commercial ambition is matched by operational readiness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Paid &amp;amp; Organic Integration:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Build strategies that unify paid, organic, creator and affiliate activity into a single commercial system rather than parallel channels with separate objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Content &amp;amp; Creator Strategy:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Work with client editorial, creative and marketing teams to define content-to-cart strategies, creator and affiliate programmes (including commission architecture and creator economics), and LIVE formats that convert.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Ecosystem Expertise:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Maintain authoritative depth across TikTok Shop, Meta, YouTube and emerging social and AI-led commerce surfaces – including partner ecosystems, betas and platform roadmaps – and translate it into first-mover advantage for clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Client &amp;amp; business leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Senior Client Counsel:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Act as trusted strategic advisor to senior client stakeholders up to Marketing Director, Commercial Director and GM level – as credible in a commercial conversation as a creative one, and able to disagree well when the data says so.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Scoping &amp;amp; Commercial Shaping of Work:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Interrogate and shape briefs, define scope and approach, input into resourcing, estimates and statements of work, and ensure what we sell is what we can brilliantly deliver.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Growth &amp;amp; New Business:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Identify and shape opportunities to extend the work – new markets, brands and workstreams – and bring senior strategic firepower to pitches, RFPs and capability sessions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Presentation &amp;amp; Persuasion:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Build and deliver arguments that land in the room – clear narrative, sharp commercial framing, and the confidence to present to senior executives and defend the recommendation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Thought Leadership:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Develop points of view, frameworks and IP that position VML as the leading end-to-end social commerce partner, and represent the agency externally with clients, platforms and at industry events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Team &amp;amp; delivery leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;People Leadership:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Line-manage and develop a small team of strategists – setting objectives, coaching, reviewing work, and raising the commercial literacy and craft standard across the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Lead multi-discipline pods across creative, media, data, technology and delivery, ensuring social commerce strategy is integrated with the wider marketing and commerce agenda.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Delivery Accountability:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Lead projects end to end – on time, on budget and to the standard we want to be judged by – managing dependencies, risk and scope in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Client Location Work:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Willingness to work at client locations and travel to key markets as the work requires.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What we want from you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;34&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Substantial experience in social, digital or commerce strategy – typically 7+ years, with meaningful time spent on social commerce specifically, agency or brand side.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;34&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Genuine commercial fluency: comfortable building and defending a channel P&amp;amp;L, unit economics and a forecast, and as confident in a model as in a deck.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;34&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrable experience setting KPIs and being held to them – you have owned the performance of a channel or programme, not just the plan for it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;34&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep, current expertise across social platforms and their commerce ecosystems, with hands-on TikTok Shop experience (Seller Centre, Affiliate Centre, GMV Max, LIVE, Shop Health) strongly preferred, alongside Meta.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
