&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;On a day-to-day basis you will&amp;nbsp;lead across all&amp;nbsp;analysis projects,&amp;nbsp;ensuring the final&amp;nbsp;delivering&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;to a high degree of accuracy. You will mentor and manage a diverse group of analysts,&amp;nbsp;inspiring and reassuring them,&amp;nbsp;ensuring they are&amp;nbsp;confident in their work and delivering to the&amp;nbsp;optimal&amp;nbsp;level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
