&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience writing Python for testing, automation, data analysis, and robot interaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with C++ is a plus (especially for writing tests, tools, or interfacing with robot drivers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of core robotics concepts, including kinematics, dynamics, singularities, joint limits, URDFs, coordinate transformations, and motion constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencein&amp;nbsp; testing and validating software and hardware modules in integrated robotic systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design, execute, and analyze structured test plans — including edge case testing, regression testing, and real-world scenario validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong debugging skills across software and hardware layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Git, JIRA, and structured issue tracking workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset with attention to detail and system-level understanding• Excellent communication and documentation skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
