&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Ideally expertise in one or more industries (e.g. Manufacturing, Automotive, Consumer, Retail, Pharmaceuticals, Chemicals) and the ability to develop a deep understanding of industry trends and strategic opportunities&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree: &lt;/strong&gt;In Technology &amp;amp; Management, Industrial/Business Engineering, Business Informatics, Computer Science, Mathematics, Economics or a comparable degree program&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native-level or near-native German language skills (written and spoken), with the ability to confidently engage German-speaking customers, facilitate workshops, and present to executive stakeholders.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role is based in Munich.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Fraud Alert&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve learned that scammers are impersonating Commvault team members—including HR and leadership—via email or text. These bad actors may conduct fake interviews and ask for personal information, such as your social security number. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to know:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commvault does&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;not&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;conduct interviews by email or text.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We will never ask you to submit sensitive documents (including banking information, SSN, etc) before your first day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commvault recruiters may contact prospective candidates through LinkedIn and other professional networking platforms regarding career opportunities. If you are unsure whether a recruiting communication is legitimate, review the profile to ensure they have a badge verifying them as a Commvault employee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you suspect a recruiting scam, please contact us at &lt;u&gt;&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Commvault&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault (NASDAQ: CVLT) delivers continuous recovery for the AI era. We help organizations stay ready for constant disruption by returning critical data, applications, identities, and AI systems to a clean, trusted state. Our purpose-built recovery solutions span cloud-native and hybrid environments, leveraging AI to enable resilience at enterprise scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Commercial Account Executive, who will be responsible for achieving quota by selling solutions into a defined territory that includes current Commvault customers and prospects. The position is a field sales account, new business focussed role where the AE will engage in face-to-face sales with customers and prospects either directly or through partners across Germany!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AE must have the ability to articulate an in-depth understanding of the prospect’s environment, current challenges/goals and have the ability to align Commvault solutions to those challenges/goals including a financial and strategic value proposition. The candidate must have a history of success in selling sophisticated software platforms (vs. IT component or narrow focused tools) to new logo accounts and have significant experience selling within the local partner ecosystem&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and qualify leads and generate new business opportunities in order to achieve revenue quota on a quarterly and annual basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high level of face-to-face meeting activity with customers, prospects and partners on a weekly basis - encouraging strategic working relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop territory plan to leverage partners, alliances and existing relationships to build and maintain a robust pipeline of new logo opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and build strategic partner relationships, assisting in rolling out partner programs and partner sales and technical enablement to aid in pipeline generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and present sales proposals and presentations to new and existing clients with strategic and technical value propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and close deals following the company’s practices and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage internal sales tools and processes to drive opportunities to a successful close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, attend and coordinate executive briefings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure an impressive level of industry, Commvault and competitive knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shown success in Software &amp;amp; SaaS Sales within Data Protection/Security industry, demonstrating knowledge of products, competitors, history, emerging trends and changing marketplace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in identifying, building relationships and selling with channel partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in IT infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of MEDDICC or Command of the Message sales methodology or similar would be an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent verbal &amp;amp; written German &amp;amp; English Language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll love working here because:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High income earning opportunities based on self performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for Presidents Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSU) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales training in MEDDIC and Command of the Message&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, opportunity to join our Community Guilds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous global benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-SK1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;jd-info au-target&quot; data-ph-at-id=&quot;jobdescription-text&quot; data-ph-id=&quot;ph-page-element-page5-4e8TMw&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault is an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. We are always committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or Veteran status and we will not discriminate against on the basis of such characteristics or any other status protected by the laws or regulations in the locations where we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault’s goal is to make interviewing inclusive and accessible to all candidates and employees. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation to participate in the interview process or apply for a position at Commvault, please email &lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- any inquiries not related to an accommodation please reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.commvault.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Commvault&#39;s Privacy Policy &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Team description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Central Product Analytics team sits at the heart of how SumUp understands and improves the experience of millions of merchants using our products every day. This role owns the Engagement domain — covering merchant engagement, product activation, support responses, and navigation across the SuperApp and web dashboard — and is the primary analytics partner for the Engagement product team. It&#39;s a genuine opportunity to take full ownership of a domain, build the measurement foundations from the ground up, and shift the team from reactive reporting to proactive, insight-led decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define event taxonomies and measurement plans, implement and QA tracking (GA4), and make sure analytics is built into new product features from day one&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain scalable datasets in Snowflake — including funnels, customer behaviour models, and feature adoption metrics — and use them to generate insights that directly inform product decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and evaluate A/B tests: define success metrics, assess statistical validity, and communicate results clearly to product and engineering stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create and maintain intuitive dashboards and reusable query templates in Tableau that help teams answer their own questions without always needing an analyst&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with product managers to develop and map out KPI trees, identify measurement gaps, and improve the quality and accuracy of engagement tracking across the domain&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience as a Data or Product Analyst, with a strong track record of working with customer behaviour data and translating it into product decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL, including writing, optimising, and validating queries, building data models, and participating in code reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong knowledge of data visualisation tools such as Tableau or Power BI, and experience with data warehousing platforms like Snowflake, Postgres, or Redshift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable designing and analysing end-to-end experiments, including A/B tests and feature flag rollouts, with a solid understanding of statistical validity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to communicate complex data findings clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders, with strong written and verbal English skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup &lt;br&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced &lt;br&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success &lt;br&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education &lt;br&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions &lt;br&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days &lt;br&gt;🏋️ Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches &lt;br&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service &lt;br&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to transform the way people shop and eat, connecting consumers, restaurants, shops, and riders to bring the neighbourhood to their door. We&#39;re redefining convenience by giving customers the ability to buy what they want, as they want it, when and where they want it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is a technology-driven company at the forefront of one of the world&#39;s most dynamic industries. We are a relatively small team making a very large impact, moving fast, valuing ownership, and tackling some of the most interesting challenges in global commerce. We&#39;re driven by innovation, autonomy, and the ambition to deliver exceptional experiences for our customers, partners, and riders alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own frontline operational performance across two closely linked parts of Deliveroo&#39;s customer support network: an in-house Global Escalations team of around 50 agents based across the UK and Georgia, and the outsourced network delivering support on our behalf through three BPO partners and three Shared Service Centres, circa 1,500 agents across multiple locations, including the team leads and ops managers embedded within those outsourced functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global Escalations sits at the heart of Deliveroo&#39;s most critical customer moments. The team manages our most sensitive, high-risk, and high-impact contacts, including complaints escalated to the Executive team. As the leader directly accountable for this recovery-focused centre of excellence, you will ensure the team operates with exceptional skill, judgement, and empathy, protecting Deliveroo&#39;s reputation, driving improvement through root cause analysis, and embedding a culture of integrity and customer-first recovery across the organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For the outsourced network, you own how performance is delivered day to day, working closely with the team leads and ops managers embedded in each BPO and Shared Service Centre, not just the vendor relationship at arm&#39;s length. You own the operational rigour needed to make the network the best in class, from an experience and consistency perspective, across every market it supports.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your key objective is to drive qualitative improvements to the customer experience, measured through CSAT, while balancing cost metrics like average handling time (AHT) and refund costs, rather than trading one off against the other. You will be the voice of Support to Deliveroo&#39;s market General Managers, taking full accountability for the Support experience in your markets, and you will partner closely with cross-functional Support &amp;amp; Operations teams, including Workforce Management, Training, Quality, and Policy, to drive initiatives that positively impact all three sides of the marketplace: customers, riders, and merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own frontline operational performance delivered through the in-house Global Escalations team (UK and Georgia) and the outsourced network (3 BPOs, 3 Shared Service Centres, circa 1,500 agents), including the team leads and ops managers within those outsourced functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop the Global Escalations team directly, managing our most sensitive and reputation-critical contacts with judgement, empathy, and rigorous root cause analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive qualitative improvements to the customer experience, tracked through CSAT, while balancing cost metrics like AHT and refund costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the voice of Support to Deliveroo market GMs, taking full accountability for the Support experience in your markets and representing their priorities back into the function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Support &amp;amp; Operations cross-functional teams, including Workforce Management, Training, Quality, and Policy, to drive initiatives that improve the experience for customers, riders, and merchants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run performance frameworks that hold BPO and SSC team leads and ops managers accountable for quality, SLA adherence, and CSAT, fostering a culture of partnership rather than pure oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardise processes and playbooks across outsourced partners and sites where it drives consistency, while respecting genuine market and site-specific differences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and help bring down attrition and quality issues across the outsourced network, working with BPO and SSC leadership on the retention, engagement, and workforce planning changes needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Technology to shape the roadmap for customer support systems and channel strategy, identifying opportunities to enhance efficiency and automation across both in-house and outsourced teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with stakeholders across HR, Legal, and Policy to ensure service delivery evolves in line with business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data-informed improvement through analysis of contact drivers, escalation themes, and customer sentiment, translating insight into action for both Global Escalations and the outsourced network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the function at relevant Weekly Business Reviews and senior forums, providing visibility on performance, risk, and recovery across both the in-house team and the outsourced network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the 24/7 Leadership Team on-call rota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape functional strategy and set OKRs for contact centre Support across Deliveroo markets, growing the remit from directing your own team to leading leaders, in line with DoorDash&#39;s Team Management career framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow and develop the managers and leaders within your network, including Team Leads inside Global Escalations and the team leads and ops managers at each BPO and Shared Service Centre, building the next generation of people leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive contact centre, BPO, or shared service centre leadership experience in a fast-paced, consumer-facing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing outsourced or vendor relationships at scale, including the team lead and ops manager layer embedded within partner organisations, not just the commercial relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading escalations or complaint handling in a reputation-sensitive environment, with strong judgement and the ability to drive recovery from the most sensitive customer moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of bringing consistency and governance across multiple outsourced partners while respecting genuine local and market differences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience diagnosing and reducing attrition while improving quality, in a large-scale, multi-site support operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven approach to balancing customer experience (CSAT) against cost metrics such as AHT and refund rate, without trading one off blindly against the other&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience representing a support or operations function to senior commercial stakeholders, such as General Managers or market leadership, taking full accountability for their experience of the function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with cross-functional teams such as Workforce Management, Training, Quality, and Policy to drive improvements across a multi-sided marketplace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional stakeholder management and communication skills, with the ability to influence senior leaders and work cross-functionally with Product, Legal, Policy, and People teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical ability, comfortable turning contact driver, escalation, and sentiment data into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership skills, with experience building and developing a dispersed in-house team and driving performance indirectly through partner leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter mindset, a can-do attitude, and willingness to be hands-on in a fast-moving, multi-geography environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven strategic mindset with a track record of shaping and executing operational strategies across multiple markets and vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep operational understanding, including customer service design, vendor management, and process optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to deliver results in high-volume, complex environments with multiple priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with Product and Tech to drive tooling, system, and automation improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mindset focused on continuous improvement, customer advocacy, and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate at a &#39;leads leaders&#39; level per DoorDash&#39;s Levels and Expectations framework (Team Management track): shaping strategy and OKRs beyond your own team, and developing managers who in turn develop their own teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meets the senior people-leadership bar DoorDash expects at this level: effectively leads a high-performing team, fosters a culture of belonging and engagement, and takes full accountability for the people outcomes of a large, dispersed organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Willst Du, dass Deine Arbeit eine echte Bedeutung &amp;amp; spürbare Auswirkung für uns als Gesellschaft hat? Hast Du Lust mit einem großartigen Team eine sichere, digitale Zukunft aufzubauen?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(222, 220, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;„In der Portfolio Unit Security &amp;amp; IT Solutions sorgen wir für die Sicherheit und Stabilität der IT-Systeme unserer Kunden. Gemeinsam übernehmen wir hier Verantwortung, liefern Produkte und professionellen Service, entwickeln und betreiben Lösungen und sorgen mit Freude dafür, dass die Welt ein Stück sicherer wird.&quot; - Christoph Wolf, Director PU Security &amp;amp; IT Solutions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du fühlst Dich angesprochen und möchtest gemeinsam mit uns die Welt sicherer machen? Unser Team wächst stetig und wir suchen Dich als &lt;strong&gt;System&amp;nbsp;Engineer (m/w/d)&lt;/strong&gt; für Proxmox-Plattform an unserem Standort in &lt;strong&gt;Köln &lt;/strong&gt;oder &lt;strong&gt;Wiesbaden &lt;/strong&gt;mit der Option zum mobilen Arbeiten. Gemeinsam sorgen wir für den erfolgreichen Betrieb und die Weiterentwicklung moderner Virtualisierungsplattformen bei unseren Kunden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WAS DU BEI UNS MACHST&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aufbau, Weiterentwicklung und Betrieb unserer zukünftigen Virtualisierungsplattform auf Basis von Proxmox VE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planung und Durchführung von Migrationsprojekten im Rahmen der strategischen Ablösung bestehender VMware-Umgebungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integration und Weiterentwicklung von Storage-, Netzwerk- und SDN-Komponenten zur Sicherstellung einer leistungsfähigen und hochverfügbaren Infrastruktur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erstellung von Betriebs-, Architektur- und Migrationskonzepten sowie Unterstützung bei Technologie- und Architekturentscheidungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automatisierung und Optimierung von Betriebsprozessen sowie Sicherstellung eines stabilen Betriebs der Plattform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WIE DU UNS BEGEISTERST&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfolgreich abgeschlossene Ausbildung im IT-Umfeld, ein Studium der Informatik oder eine vergleichbare Qualifikation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mehrjährige Erfahrung im Betrieb und der Weiterentwicklung von Virtualisierungsplattformen sowie praktische Erfahrung mit Proxmox VE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Linux-Kenntnisse sowie fundiertes Know-how in den Bereichen Enterprise Storage, Netzwerkarchitekturen und SDN-Technologien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in Infrastrukturtransformations- und Migrationsprojekten sowie ein ausgeprägtes Architekturverständnis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hohe Eigenverantwortung sowie &lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Bereitschaft für Rufbereitschaften bzw. geplante 24/7 Wartungsarbeiten&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FEEL GOOD KULTUR @SITSGROUP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wertschätzung:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Eine offen-herzliche, respektvolle und wertschätzende Kommunikationskultur steht bei uns an erster Stelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;Teamspirit:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Es erwarten Dich spannende und vielseitige Aufgaben gepaart mit einem tollen und unterstützenden Team um Dich herum. Wir fördern nicht nur eine gesunde, sondern auch kollegiale Teamstruktur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onboarding &amp;amp; Einarbeitung: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Wir legen großen Wert auf ein strukturiertes Onboarding und eine intensive Einarbeitung. Wir möchten, dass Du bei uns gut ankommst!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Blending:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Wir bieten Dir die Option auf mobiles Arbeiten und flexible Arbeitszeitmodelle mit Fokus auf eine gesunde Work-Life-Balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perspektiven:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Du erhältst vielfältige Freiräume für kreatives Arbeiten, persönliche Entwicklungsoptionen und interessante Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten – auch im Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Corporate Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Auf Dich warten interessante und zahlreiche Mitarbeiterkonditionen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hire a Friend&lt;/strong&gt;!: &lt;/span&gt;Empfehle Deinen Wunschkollegen! Unser lukratives Mitarbeiterempfehlungsprogramm liegt uns besonders am Herzen und macht sich auch für Dich bezahlt!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Workplace:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Du erhältst von uns eine moderne IT-Ausstattung (bspw. Firmenlaptop, Headsets, Zweitbildschirm, Smartphone etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Großartige Unternehmenskultur:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Wir pflegen eine offene Du-Kultur und feiern legendäre größere und kleinere Teamevents!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ÜBERZEUGT? SO GEHT’S WEITER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns über Deinen aussagekräftigen CV, den Du über das untenstehende Formular hochladen kannst. Ein Anschreiben darfst Du gerne weglassen. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Solltest Du uns noch weitere Dokumente zur Verfügung stellen wollen, kannst Du sie in diesem Feld einfügen. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Wir freuen uns sehr Dich kennenzulernen!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DU WILLST NOCH MEHR ÜBER UNS WISSEN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SITS Group&lt;/strong&gt; - Sicherheit braucht Partner: Als führende Unternehmensgruppe für IT Security stehen wir für eine ganzheitliche Sicherheit. Mit über 700 Mitarbeitenden vereint die SITS Group Erfahrung, Kompetenz, Ressourcen und Services hochkarätiger IT Security-Provider zu einem umfassenden Ganzen. Für unsere Kunden bieten wir mithilfe innovativer Lösungen und Technologien Gesamtkonzepte zur IT Security, die auf den Aspekten Schützen, Erkennen und Abwehren beruhen. Dazu zählen der Einsatz maßgeschneiderter Strategien, die Sensibilisierung der Mitarbeitenden sowie weitreichende Servicepakete. Sämtliche Prozesse in Unternehmen werden immer stärker digital vernetzt. Dank aufeinander abgestimmter Maßnahmen und einem mehrschichtigen Schutzsystem sind unsere Kunden für die Zukunft gewappnet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hilf uns die IT-Sicherheit unserer Kunden zu schützen und werde Teil unserer großartigen Vision mit einem einzigartigen Teamgeist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KONTAKT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bei Fragen kannst Du Dich gerne per &lt;a ----- an&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #b4c832;&quot;&gt;▶ Anna Scherer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; (Talent Acquisition Partnerin) wenden.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

