&lt;li&gt;Support reconciliation workflows and data validation processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to documentation and process improvement initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with senior analysts and engineers to learn the Addepar data stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
