&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and experience with at least one scripting language (Python preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with attention to detail and data quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in financial data, portfolio management, or fintech&lt;/li&gt;
